WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club


00:00:40.655 --> 00:00:42.554
- Hmm.


00:00:42.723 --> 00:00:44.890
Captain Severus, Captain Tad!


00:00:44.892 --> 00:00:47.493
- Uhh! Uhh!
- What do you see?


00:00:47.495 --> 00:00:49.962
- Sharp Tooth
is still advancing!


00:00:49.964 --> 00:00:51.930
- Advancing?
- There!


00:00:51.932 --> 00:00:52.998
On the northern flank!


00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:54.667
- Where? Where?
I want to see!


00:00:54.669 --> 00:00:56.368
Let me see!
- It's too late!


00:00:56.370 --> 00:00:59.471
General Sharp Tooth has
used the power of the gem!


00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:02.975
- That means General Star
didn't steal the gem!


00:01:02.977 --> 00:01:06.879
- She didn't?
- We don't know that.


00:01:06.881 --> 00:01:09.381
General Sharp Tooth
can still use the power


00:01:09.383 --> 00:01:11.417
of the gem even
if it were stolen.


00:01:11.419 --> 00:01:15.087
- I told you!
You can't trust an orc.


00:01:15.089 --> 00:01:16.622
- Boo!


00:01:16.624 --> 00:01:17.890
- Whoa!


00:01:17.892 --> 00:01:19.958
I'm okay.
I'm okay.


00:01:19.960 --> 00:01:22.061
- Nice hat, Tad.


00:01:22.463 --> 00:01:23.462
- Star, did you get it?


00:01:23.464 --> 00:01:27.700
- One mind-controlling gem,
as promised.


00:01:28.069 --> 00:01:31.670
Hmm.
That is, if you trust me.


00:01:32.340 --> 00:01:34.940
- It's so shiny!


00:01:34.942 --> 00:01:37.443
- Don't touch, Tad!


00:01:37.445 --> 00:01:39.745
- The gem of the Mountain!


00:01:39.747 --> 00:01:41.580
- Of course, we trust you.


00:01:41.582 --> 00:01:45.984
- Then you will destroy it
and free my people.


00:01:45.986 --> 00:01:47.586
- Hmm, I knew you could do it.


00:01:47.588 --> 00:01:51.724
We haven't much time.
They're close!


00:01:58.632 --> 00:01:59.998
- What do you see?


00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:01.467
- Sharp Tooth is here!


00:02:01.469 --> 00:02:04.636
- What? Now?


00:02:04.638 --> 00:02:05.637
- You ready?


00:02:05.639 --> 00:02:08.073
- Captain Severus,
sound the alarm!


00:02:08.075 --> 00:02:09.775
Let's go save the world.


00:02:09.777 --> 00:02:13.545
- Mind-controlling gem
as promised.


00:02:32.933 --> 00:02:36.101
- Those are big orcs!


00:02:46.614 --> 00:02:50.416
- Elves!
Arm your magic!


00:03:11.906 --> 00:03:13.472
- Huh?


00:03:25.986 --> 00:03:29.555
- Okay, let's do this.


00:03:30.724 --> 00:03:32.958
You were very brave, Star.


00:03:32.960 --> 00:03:34.526
Your axe!


00:03:34.528 --> 00:03:35.828
- My axe?


00:03:36.163 --> 00:03:39.131
- Trust me, please!


00:03:41.969 --> 00:03:44.203
Star, we haven't much time!


00:03:44.205 --> 00:03:47.206
- Orcs, find my gem!


00:03:48.476 --> 00:03:50.542
- For peace!


00:03:50.544 --> 00:03:51.043
- Yes.


00:03:51.045 --> 00:03:53.545
This peace will last as long
as we trust each other.


00:03:53.547 --> 00:03:58.617
- They're over that hill
and they have my gem!


00:04:00.955 --> 00:04:03.522
- Rubicon! Epsilon!


00:04:03.524 --> 00:04:07.793
Oh, mighty axe, we give you
the power to destroy the hate,


00:04:07.795 --> 00:04:11.730
destroy the fear and
to destroy this gem!


00:04:11.732 --> 00:04:13.065
- Oh! Wait!


00:04:13.067 --> 00:04:15.067
- What?


00:04:15.069 --> 00:04:17.536
- Hurry!
Keep chanting!


00:04:18.138 --> 00:04:21.507
- I'm done.
It's up to you now, Star.


00:04:21.509 --> 00:04:24.943
You must destroy
General Sharp Tooth's gem!


00:04:30.751 --> 00:04:33.519
- Wait! Star!


00:04:33.521 --> 00:04:35.554
I knew I smelled a traitor!


00:04:35.556 --> 00:04:38.690
- Hey, there, Sharp Tooth.
Time to split.


00:04:38.692 --> 00:04:39.691
- What are you doing?


00:04:39.693 --> 00:04:43.529
You're destroying orc
domination!


00:04:43.531 --> 00:04:45.864
No!


00:05:07.121 --> 00:05:10.289
- Hi, Teddy.
- Hi, Boris.


00:05:13.227 --> 00:05:15.661
- We did it.


00:05:22.303 --> 00:05:26.238
- And who can tell me
what happened next?


00:05:27.775 --> 00:05:29.641
Anyone?


00:05:29.643 --> 00:05:31.610
Yes, Hermey?


00:05:31.612 --> 00:05:33.178
- After splitting the gemstone,


00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:36.715
the mind control
of the orcs was broken.


00:05:36.717 --> 00:05:38.850
- Thank you, Hermey.


00:05:38.852 --> 00:05:44.790
- And then elves and orcs
lived together in peace.


00:05:45.626 --> 00:05:48.327
- Yes, thank you, Hermey.


00:05:48.329 --> 00:05:49.962
- Forever and forever.


00:05:49.964 --> 00:05:51.863
Miss Tenderfoot?
- What is it now, Hermey?


00:05:51.865 --> 00:05:54.933
- If orcs and elves
get along so well,


00:05:54.935 --> 00:06:00.205
then why is the only orc that
goes to this school not here?


00:06:00.207 --> 00:06:02.007
- Well, he's...


00:06:02.009 --> 00:06:05.877
- Doing what all orcs do,
getting into trouble.


00:06:07.247 --> 00:06:10.015
- Um...


00:06:10.017 --> 00:06:12.684
Can't I get
a little respect?


00:06:12.686 --> 00:06:13.986
Barl?


00:06:32.172 --> 00:06:33.205
- Whoops!


00:06:33.207 --> 00:06:35.907
Shh, shh! Whoa, whoa, whoa!


00:06:35.909 --> 00:06:37.242
- Smooth.


00:06:37.244 --> 00:06:38.744
You're late.


00:06:38.746 --> 00:06:39.645
- Hey, Forelle.


00:06:39.647 --> 00:06:41.713
- Where do you want this?


00:06:41.715 --> 00:06:44.082
- Whoa, it's perfect!


00:06:44.084 --> 00:06:48.120
Um... uh...
there!


00:06:48.989 --> 00:06:51.423
- You must really
hate your brother.


00:06:51.425 --> 00:06:54.226
- What? No!
Why would you think that?


00:06:54.228 --> 00:06:56.728
Lloyd loves pranks
as much as I do.


00:06:56.730 --> 00:06:57.929
- The prank is on him.


00:06:57.931 --> 00:06:59.831
You're sliming your brother.


00:06:59.833 --> 00:07:02.200
- And...?
- On graduation day?


00:07:02.202 --> 00:07:05.237
- And...?
- In front of everyone.


00:07:05.239 --> 00:07:07.773
Whatever.
Your funeral.


00:07:07.775 --> 00:07:10.075
- It's the best prank ever.


00:07:10.077 --> 00:07:12.744
He always tries to be
the center of attention


00:07:12.746 --> 00:07:15.847
being valedictorian
and everything.


00:07:15.849 --> 00:07:17.349
He'll love it!


00:07:17.351 --> 00:07:20.852
- He's lucky to have
you as a brother.


00:07:20.854 --> 00:07:22.988
Lucky Lloyd.


00:07:25.826 --> 00:07:27.993
- Lumos discous.


00:07:31.432 --> 00:07:33.131
- Excellent, Lloyd,


00:07:33.133 --> 00:07:34.399
but the Krune University
recruiter


00:07:34.401 --> 00:07:36.134
will want more
than just dancing lights.


00:07:36.136 --> 00:07:39.271
We're talking about
the best of the best.


00:07:39.273 --> 00:07:41.473
Can you dazzle me?


00:07:43.410 --> 00:07:45.310
- Dazzle, huh?


00:07:46.847 --> 00:07:50.482
Illusios Dracanos!


00:08:00.260 --> 00:08:01.359
- Incredible.


00:08:01.361 --> 00:08:03.395
They're gonna love you!


00:08:03.397 --> 00:08:05.297
- Oh, thanks,
Principal Ashford.


00:08:05.299 --> 00:08:08.266
- Krune University.
I'm so proud.


00:08:08.268 --> 00:08:11.269
You know, I was a graduate
of Krune University.


00:08:11.271 --> 00:08:13.171
- Uh, can we go check
on the lighting?


00:08:13.173 --> 00:08:15.006
- Yes, of course.
Good lighting is key.


00:08:15.008 --> 00:08:17.809
Good lighting, it makes
you look heroic and thin!


00:08:17.811 --> 00:08:20.846
Not that you need that.
I mean, you're perfect!


00:08:20.848 --> 00:08:24.282
You're a perfect student
of Elfdale High.


00:08:25.219 --> 00:08:30.355
- You know, there are easier
ways to pull a prank, Barl.


00:08:30.891 --> 00:08:32.157
- This is gonna be great!


00:08:32.159 --> 00:08:34.259
- You can put
spiders in his shoes


00:08:34.261 --> 00:08:36.528
or replace his soda with ink,


00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:39.498
all very reasonable.


00:08:41.235 --> 00:08:43.101
That doesn't look very safe.


00:08:43.103 --> 00:08:47.539
- Perfectly set.
Okay, hand me the milk.


00:08:50.377 --> 00:08:52.344
Hand me the milk.


00:08:53.147 --> 00:08:53.879
- What?


00:08:53.881 --> 00:08:57.149
- I said...
Oh, thanks, Forelle.


00:08:57.151 --> 00:08:59.151
- Do you need me to do
anything else for you?


00:08:59.153 --> 00:09:02.454
Do your homework?
Cook your breakfast?


00:09:02.456 --> 00:09:03.455
Oh, I know!


00:09:03.457 --> 00:09:07.793
I can dye your hair and
give you a nose ring.


00:09:13.167 --> 00:09:14.299
Wow!


00:09:14.301 --> 00:09:17.936
The drama, the danger.


00:09:17.938 --> 00:09:21.940
- Great!
I need more milk.


00:09:21.942 --> 00:09:24.109
- It does the body good.


00:09:24.111 --> 00:09:25.844
- Go get some, please?


00:09:25.846 --> 00:09:29.481
- Fine! I'll get more.


00:09:30.150 --> 00:09:33.285
You're not supposed
to know magic anyway.


00:09:33.287 --> 00:09:34.519
You're not an elf.


00:09:34.521 --> 00:09:38.223
- With the right ingredients,
everything is magic!


00:09:38.225 --> 00:09:39.157
Hey!
- What?


00:09:39.159 --> 00:09:42.327
- You're shaking the catwalk!
Don't shake it!


00:09:43.564 --> 00:09:45.063
I'm serious, Forelle!


00:09:46.133 --> 00:09:47.165
- See you later, Barl!


00:09:47.167 --> 00:09:49.134
- Did I ever tell you about
the time I was voted


00:09:49.136 --> 00:09:51.536
most likely to
be a politician or a lawyer?


00:09:51.538 --> 00:09:52.504
- Oh, gnome biscuits!


00:09:52.506 --> 00:09:55.507
- True story.
People said I had moxie!


00:09:55.509 --> 00:09:56.875
Moxie! Can you believe it?


00:09:56.877 --> 00:09:59.377
- Principal Ashford,
is this where I'll be standing


00:09:59.379 --> 00:10:02.447
for my valedictorian speech?


00:10:02.449 --> 00:10:05.116
- Huh?
Yeah, right there.


00:10:07.154 --> 00:10:08.153
- Huh?


00:10:08.155 --> 00:10:13.491
- Wait. Sorry, Lloyd.
It goes over here.


00:10:16.063 --> 00:10:16.995
- Oh, no.


00:10:16.997 --> 00:10:22.200
- Sorry, Principal Ashford,
but the lighting's better here.


00:10:23.503 --> 00:10:26.471
- Oh, boy...


00:10:26.473 --> 00:10:30.108
No!


00:10:37.251 --> 00:10:40.585
- I'm at my wit's end,
Mr. and Mrs. Lightspinner!


00:10:40.587 --> 00:10:44.990
I'm afraid this prank
was the last straw.


00:10:44.992 --> 00:10:47.225
- There has to be
something we can do.


00:10:47.227 --> 00:10:49.527
- Barl is an orc,
Mrs. Lightspinner.


00:10:49.529 --> 00:10:52.364
You took him in
when he had no one,


00:10:52.366 --> 00:10:55.000
raised him as best you could.


00:10:55.002 --> 00:10:57.535
But I'm sorry.


00:10:57.537 --> 00:10:59.504
Barl is expelled.


00:10:59.506 --> 00:11:04.576
- I have to hand it to you.
You went out big.


00:11:04.578 --> 00:11:06.411
- It was just a prank.


00:11:06.413 --> 00:11:07.979
Brothers tease each other.


00:11:07.981 --> 00:11:09.314
- Not about this, Barl!


00:11:09.316 --> 00:11:12.217
This is the most important
day of my life!


00:11:12.219 --> 00:11:16.388
Do you even understand
what I have to lose here?


00:11:16.390 --> 00:11:18.056
- Krune University.


00:11:18.058 --> 00:11:22.060
- Exactly.
Krune University!


00:11:24.698 --> 00:11:26.264
- I thought it would be funny,


00:11:26.266 --> 00:11:28.500
like when we used
to make snot poppers.


00:11:28.502 --> 00:11:30.702
- That was in
the fourth grade, Barl.


00:11:30.704 --> 00:11:32.938
I don't have time
for snot poppers!


00:11:32.940 --> 00:11:34.406
I'm under a lot of stress!


00:11:34.408 --> 00:11:37.542
You have any idea
how big this is?


00:11:37.544 --> 00:11:38.376
- Yeah, I do.


00:11:38.378 --> 00:11:40.979
It's all you've talked
about for four years.


00:11:40.981 --> 00:11:41.713
Krune University!


00:11:41.715 --> 00:11:43.415
If I don't get
in to this university,


00:11:43.417 --> 00:11:48.253
I'm going to be a big fat
loser like my baby brother!


00:11:48.255 --> 00:11:49.654
- That's not fair!


00:11:49.656 --> 00:11:53.158
Look, I grew up, you didn't.


00:11:53.160 --> 00:11:55.160
That's a fact.


00:11:55.162 --> 00:11:56.528
You want to still be
in fourth grade


00:11:56.530 --> 00:11:59.297
making snot poppers
and fart buckets.


00:11:59.299 --> 00:12:01.032
But I am an adult now.


00:12:01.034 --> 00:12:03.068
And you're still a baby.


00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:05.136
- Am not!
- Are too.


00:12:05.138 --> 00:12:07.038
- Am not!
- Are too! Are!


00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:09.207
Oh, you're impossible!


00:12:09.209 --> 00:12:10.241
- Poor Lloyd Lightspinner,


00:12:10.243 --> 00:12:11.576
cursed with an orc
for a brother!


00:12:11.578 --> 00:12:15.080
Well, unless you figure out
how to magic me away,


00:12:15.082 --> 00:12:18.116
you're stuck with me!


00:12:32.632 --> 00:12:34.432
- Yes, Mr. President.


00:12:34.434 --> 00:12:39.504
Of course, I'll be creating
new magic for everyone.


00:12:39.506 --> 00:12:40.372
Wait! Barl?


00:12:40.374 --> 00:12:43.208
Barl?
What... What are you doing?


00:12:43.210 --> 00:12:44.642
No! No slime, Barl!


00:12:44.644 --> 00:12:48.246
No! The slime!
The slime!


00:12:48.248 --> 00:12:50.382
The slime!


00:12:53.186 --> 00:12:54.452
Barl!


00:13:10.170 --> 00:13:11.269
Barl?


00:13:11.271 --> 00:13:14.272
Barl, wake up.
Wake up right now!


00:13:17.611 --> 00:13:21.312
Wake up!
You're doing it on purpose!


00:13:21.314 --> 00:13:22.781
Barl!


00:13:22.783 --> 00:13:24.716
Ah!


00:13:25.786 --> 00:13:28.686
No, no, no, no!
Don't go back to sleep!


00:13:28.688 --> 00:13:31.089
- Lloyd?
Hey, what are you...


00:13:31.091 --> 00:13:33.558
- I had an idea that's
gonna help us both out.


00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:37.162
What you said outside
of Principal Ashford's office


00:13:37.164 --> 00:13:39.631
about brothers
pranking one another?


00:13:39.633 --> 00:13:42.133
- Yeah?


00:13:42.135 --> 00:13:44.102
- Well, surprise!


00:13:44.104 --> 00:13:46.137
I'm kidnapping you.


00:13:46.139 --> 00:13:47.205
I mean, pranking you.


00:13:47.207 --> 00:13:49.574
We're going on
a road trip, buddy.


00:13:49.576 --> 00:13:51.476
Pack something clean.


00:13:51.478 --> 00:13:53.244
- But graduation!


00:13:53.246 --> 00:13:54.079
- Is in two days.


00:13:54.081 --> 00:13:55.680
What I have planned
won't take long.


00:13:55.682 --> 00:14:00.251
- Sounds like a great prank!
I'm in!


00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:06.491
Hey, what about Mom and Dad?


00:14:28.882 --> 00:14:30.582
Are you pranking me now?


00:14:30.584 --> 00:14:34.719
Is this it?
'Cause this is super fun!


00:14:34.721 --> 00:14:36.855
- Ahem.


00:14:41.528 --> 00:14:44.562
- Hey, did we just
leave Elfdale?


00:14:46.233 --> 00:14:49.300
Um, so how's your
valley-dickie-torian


00:14:49.302 --> 00:14:50.301
speech going?


00:14:54.407 --> 00:14:57.675
Whoa!
Kind of going a bit fast there!


00:14:59.346 --> 00:15:02.313
Uh, you wanna play
snot poppers?


00:15:07.354 --> 00:15:09.554
- We're going on a road trip.


00:15:09.556 --> 00:15:12.724
No talking, understand?


00:15:12.726 --> 00:15:14.659
- Yep.


00:15:20.367 --> 00:15:21.799
Music?


00:15:31.211 --> 00:15:32.810
Music.


00:15:32.812 --> 00:15:34.812
- Do you know what's
wrong with you?


00:15:34.814 --> 00:15:38.850
- I'm just big-boned.
Is that where this is going?


00:15:38.852 --> 00:15:40.618
- You're an orc.


00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:42.387
- Right. See that?


00:15:42.389 --> 00:15:44.656
I don't need to be body-shamed.


00:15:44.658 --> 00:15:46.391
- And I am an elf.


00:15:46.393 --> 00:15:47.959
- I feel like this
is going somewhere.


00:15:47.961 --> 00:15:49.694
- Here's the prank,
baby brother.


00:15:49.696 --> 00:15:54.599
I'm taking you to New Orc City.


00:15:56.336 --> 00:15:58.703
- How is this... wait!


00:15:58.705 --> 00:16:00.738
Is this for a Surprise Party?


00:16:00.740 --> 00:16:01.940
Is that the prank?


00:16:01.942 --> 00:16:05.276
I'm gonna have a Surprise Party
in New Orc City?


00:16:05.278 --> 00:16:07.445
- Sure.
Happy birthday, Barl.


00:16:07.447 --> 00:16:09.747
- Look, I know you put
a lot of thought into this.


00:16:09.749 --> 00:16:14.986
And I have to tell you,
it's not my birthday.


00:16:14.988 --> 00:16:15.987
- I know.


00:16:15.989 --> 00:16:19.724
- Oh, that's why
it's a surprise!


00:16:19.726 --> 00:16:22.493
- This has nothing to do
with your birthday.


00:16:22.495 --> 00:16:23.995
I'm hiding you for two days.


00:16:23.997 --> 00:16:26.698
- Hiding?
Like hide and seek?


00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:27.398
- No.


00:16:27.400 --> 00:16:28.800
Like you need to leave me
alone for two days


00:16:28.802 --> 00:16:32.804
so I can graduate in peace and
not worry about getting slimed!


00:16:32.806 --> 00:16:33.871
- I wouldn't slime you.


00:16:33.873 --> 00:16:36.741
I only have half a barrel left
and very little milk.


00:16:36.743 --> 00:16:39.010
- You're going to stay with orcs
in New Orc City


00:16:39.012 --> 00:16:41.512
while I stay with
elves in Elfdale.


00:16:41.514 --> 00:16:42.513
Got it?
- Okay.


00:16:42.515 --> 00:16:44.616
I mean, it doesn't
really seem like a great prank


00:16:44.618 --> 00:16:45.683
if nothing gets slimed.


00:16:45.685 --> 00:16:48.586
- How do you even know how to
make things get slimed anyway?


00:16:48.588 --> 00:16:51.723
You're not an elf.
You don't know magic.


00:16:51.725 --> 00:16:52.557
- Silly Lloyd.


00:16:52.559 --> 00:16:54.993
You don't need to be
an elf to know magic.


00:16:54.995 --> 00:16:56.794
- Yes. Yes, you do.


00:16:56.796 --> 00:16:58.329
- Well, it's not a law.


00:16:58.331 --> 00:16:59.597
- It's a law of nature.


00:16:59.599 --> 00:17:02.300
- Well, then arrest me!
I know things.


00:17:02.302 --> 00:17:05.503
I certainly know how
to do your stupid tricks.


00:17:05.505 --> 00:17:07.705
- Are you reading
my spell books?


00:17:07.707 --> 00:17:10.575
- As if--
Lloyd, look out!


00:17:17.984 --> 00:17:19.517
- Oh...


00:17:21.988 --> 00:17:26.991
- My whole future just
flashed before my eyes


00:17:26.993 --> 00:17:29.327
and it was pretty good,
actually.


00:17:31.865 --> 00:17:34.065
I hope she's
coming to apologize.


00:17:34.067 --> 00:17:37.735
- Why? We almost hit her!
Not the other way around.


00:17:37.737 --> 00:17:40.571
- Her car was in
the middle of the road.


00:17:40.573 --> 00:17:44.409
Wait! Do you think that
was her plan?


00:17:44.411 --> 00:17:48.413
Get people to stop
and then rob them?


00:17:48.415 --> 00:17:49.514
- Rob them?


00:17:49.516 --> 00:17:52.717
You know, she seems nice.


00:17:53.753 --> 00:17:56.621
- What? Barl!
Don't go!


00:17:56.623 --> 00:17:58.022
She's going to kill you!


00:17:58.024 --> 00:18:00.091
I didn't think this through.


00:18:00.093 --> 00:18:02.560
- Hi! Are you okay?


00:18:02.562 --> 00:18:05.830
- My car, it has a flat tire.


00:18:05.832 --> 00:18:06.998
Oh, but my manners.


00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:10.601
I am Sophie Marie Julie
Aurelie Angelique.


00:18:10.603 --> 00:18:11.402
And you are?


00:18:11.404 --> 00:18:16.074
- Barl Lightspinner,
and that's my brother, Lloyd.


00:18:18.611 --> 00:18:20.445
- Oh, hello, Mr. Lloyd!


00:18:20.447 --> 00:18:24.349
- Aw, don't mind him.
He's an adult.


00:18:24.351 --> 00:18:25.717
Do you need help?


00:18:25.719 --> 00:18:26.818
- Yes, if you can.


00:18:26.820 --> 00:18:30.655
My daughter and I are
taking a little vacation.


00:18:32.792 --> 00:18:35.526
- Wow, are you going to help us?


00:18:35.528 --> 00:18:36.461
- I'm gonna try.


00:18:36.463 --> 00:18:40.365
- Yay! The big monster
is going to help us!


00:18:40.367 --> 00:18:41.065
- Oh, excuse her.


00:18:41.067 --> 00:18:42.834
My daughter has the manner
of a tadpole.


00:18:42.836 --> 00:18:45.069
It's the first time
she has met an orc.


00:18:45.071 --> 00:18:49.407
- Well, it's the first time
I met talking frogs.


00:18:53.012 --> 00:18:55.713
So is your car broken
or something?


00:18:55.715 --> 00:18:59.484
- It has a flat.
We cannot land safely.


00:18:59.486 --> 00:19:00.651
- Land?
- Yes.


00:19:00.653 --> 00:19:04.856
A Grippli car gets miles
to the leap, not to the gallon.


00:19:04.858 --> 00:19:08.659
Springs propel us
by leaps and bounds.


00:19:08.661 --> 00:19:09.994
- Lloyd!


00:19:09.996 --> 00:19:12.597
- Did she rob you yet?


00:19:12.599 --> 00:19:13.164
- Not yet!


00:19:13.166 --> 00:19:15.733
But her daughter
looks really dangerous!


00:19:20.673 --> 00:19:23.474
Come out here!
I need your help!


00:19:23.476 --> 00:19:24.575
Come on, Lloyd!


00:19:24.577 --> 00:19:28.679
You can kidnap me
after we help them.


00:19:29.616 --> 00:19:32.183
- Thank you so much
for your help.


00:19:32.185 --> 00:19:35.686
- Always help others.
That's what I always say.


00:19:35.688 --> 00:19:37.889
- I must have landed
on something.


00:19:37.891 --> 00:19:39.424
- You don't know how
to patch a tire.


00:19:39.426 --> 00:19:43.194
You blow stuff up, slime it,
stick stuff together.


00:19:43.196 --> 00:19:45.163
- Stick stuff together?


00:19:45.165 --> 00:19:47.565
Oh, we can make a patch!


00:19:50.003 --> 00:19:52.103
Can I borrow your gum?


00:19:52.105 --> 00:19:54.138
- Sure, Mr. Monster.


00:19:56.810 --> 00:19:57.542
- Thanks.


00:19:57.544 --> 00:19:59.610
All right, Lloyd.
You're up!


00:19:59.612 --> 00:20:01.979
- Me?
What am I supposed to do?


00:20:01.981 --> 00:20:03.080
- Uh, how about a wind spell?


00:20:03.082 --> 00:20:05.516
- Why do you want me
to blow them away?


00:20:05.518 --> 00:20:06.451
- To inflate their tire.


00:20:06.453 --> 00:20:09.821
Wow, you're the smart one,
remember?


00:20:09.823 --> 00:20:11.989
- Ugh.


00:20:13.593 --> 00:20:14.525
- What is he doing?


00:20:14.527 --> 00:20:17.929
- I think he's getting into
a magic mood or something.


00:20:17.931 --> 00:20:19.897
- What's he doing now?


00:20:19.899 --> 00:20:21.165
- Oh, all elves
have a magic bag.


00:20:21.167 --> 00:20:23.868
They can do anything.
You'll see.


00:20:23.870 --> 00:20:26.637
- Glockenspiel!
Banana peel!


00:20:26.639 --> 00:20:28.673
Inflate the Wheel!


00:20:34.848 --> 00:20:36.981
- Uh...Lloyd?


00:20:36.983 --> 00:20:39.917
Uh-oh!


00:20:47.927 --> 00:20:49.894
- Fart sounds.


00:20:49.896 --> 00:20:52.096
- Aw, man! Come on!


00:20:52.098 --> 00:20:55.633
- You put gum on a hole, Barl!


00:20:55.635 --> 00:20:57.835
- Use what you have. Jeez!


00:20:57.837 --> 00:20:59.971
It's not like
I've fixed a tire before.


00:20:59.973 --> 00:21:01.772
I don't even drive.


00:21:01.774 --> 00:21:04.108
- Exactly!
Now move it, please.


00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:06.210
I'm the smart one, remember?


00:21:06.212 --> 00:21:10.081
- It's okay.
That was a very funny noise.


00:21:12.585 --> 00:21:15.086
- Austero!
Comparo!


00:21:15.088 --> 00:21:17.154
Tire Repairo!


00:21:21.628 --> 00:21:24.161
- It's working!
You did it!


00:21:28.535 --> 00:21:30.134
- Lloyd!


00:21:30.637 --> 00:21:32.837
- It just used a little
too much magic.


00:21:32.839 --> 00:21:35.706
- Thank you again,
the both of you.


00:21:35.708 --> 00:21:38.876
- Bye, Mr. Monster!
Smell you later!


00:21:38.878 --> 00:21:40.711
- Bye!


00:21:43.983 --> 00:21:46.017
- That's so cool!


00:22:01.834 --> 00:22:04.602
Okay, I'll leave you alone.


00:22:04.604 --> 00:22:06.904
Take me to New Orc City.


00:22:09.876 --> 00:22:14.579
- I'm so glad you finally
see things my way, Barl.


00:22:14.581 --> 00:22:17.682
- Hey, does your kidnapping
include eating?


00:22:17.684 --> 00:22:19.951
I haven't eaten
since I went to bed.


00:22:19.953 --> 00:22:22.286
And I usually eat about
15 times before morning.


00:22:22.288 --> 00:22:24.922
- We'll stop tonight and
get there in the morning.


00:22:24.924 --> 00:22:28.960
- Stop tonight and
maybe we could eat?


00:22:28.962 --> 00:22:30.361
I'd love some sleep dinner,


00:22:30.363 --> 00:22:34.265
maybe some sleep dessert,
maybe both.


00:22:34.267 --> 00:22:36.233
- Yes, I understand, Mom.


00:22:36.235 --> 00:22:38.936
But I really think
it's important for me


00:22:38.938 --> 00:22:41.305
to bond with Barl right now.


00:22:42.642 --> 00:22:44.609
This is gonna be my
last time with him


00:22:44.611 --> 00:22:47.878
before I'm off
to Krune University.


00:22:48.314 --> 00:22:49.213
I need this, Mom.


00:22:49.215 --> 00:22:51.215
It's brother-brother
bonding time.


00:22:51.217 --> 00:22:54.151
Yes, of course, I'm gonna
be back for graduation.


00:22:54.153 --> 00:22:57.355
Yes, I know everyone
is gonna be there.


00:22:57.357 --> 00:23:01.158
Okay.
I love you too.


00:23:01.661 --> 00:23:02.393
- You lied to Mom?


00:23:02.395 --> 00:23:05.262
- If I told her the truth, dude,
she'd make us turn around!


00:23:05.264 --> 00:23:09.367
- And what happens when you
come home and I'm not there?


00:23:09.369 --> 00:23:13.004
- I'll think of something.


00:23:13.006 --> 00:23:13.971
- Sure. You always do.


00:23:13.973 --> 00:23:17.808
- Can I use the bathroom now
or did you stink it all up?


00:23:17.810 --> 00:23:19.644
- Go ahead.


00:23:19.646 --> 00:23:21.746
- Oh, man. Barl!


00:23:22.048 --> 00:23:24.048
- It's ripe in here!


00:23:24.684 --> 00:23:28.019
- Oh, cool! A sleep dinner
and sleep dessert.


00:23:28.021 --> 00:23:30.388
I'm getting some ice!


00:23:36.229 --> 00:23:40.331
No. Oh, man
Come on!


00:23:40.333 --> 00:23:43.768
Come on!
Come on, stop!


00:23:49.208 --> 00:23:52.843
Oh, man.
Sleep dinner plan B this.


00:23:52.845 --> 00:23:54.912
Now we're talking.


00:24:06.759 --> 00:24:08.993
Take that, vending machine!


00:24:08.995 --> 00:24:11.062
- What's going on out there?


00:24:11.064 --> 00:24:15.099
- Nothing! Just talking
to the candy machine!


00:24:22.709 --> 00:24:23.207
Finally!


00:24:23.209 --> 00:24:27.278
Oh, man, I'm ready for
my third sleep dinner already.


00:24:28.347 --> 00:24:29.246
- Hey! No, no.


00:24:29.248 --> 00:24:34.285
The best part was he didn't even
know about the orc discount.


00:24:34.287 --> 00:24:35.486
Can you believe that?


00:24:35.488 --> 00:24:39.323
Who doesn't know about
the orc discount?


00:24:39.759 --> 00:24:43.394
Well I told Rolf
right up to his eyeballs--


00:24:44.163 --> 00:24:46.063
- Hey, watch where you're going!


00:24:46.065 --> 00:24:46.997
- Sorry, ma'am.


00:24:46.999 --> 00:24:49.834
- Ma'am?
I'm not your grandma!


00:24:49.836 --> 00:24:53.337
- What?
No, of course not!


00:24:53.339 --> 00:24:54.238
- Hey, grandma.


00:24:54.240 --> 00:24:56.474
- What can
I get you, sweetheart?


00:24:56.476 --> 00:24:58.476
Come on.
I don't have all night.


00:24:58.478 --> 00:25:01.212
- Um, a chocolate milkshake,
I guess?


00:25:01.214 --> 00:25:04.181
- One choco ice turd!


00:25:06.119 --> 00:25:08.085
Here you go.


00:25:08.087 --> 00:25:09.420
- Wow! Thanks!


00:25:09.422 --> 00:25:11.222
- Two bucks.


00:25:11.457 --> 00:25:14.291
Wait...where...my bag!


00:25:14.293 --> 00:25:16.193
- Yeah, sure.
You lost your wallet.


00:25:19.332 --> 00:25:20.331
- Hey, that's mine!


00:25:20.333 --> 00:25:24.135
- Yeah. I don't see
your name on it, kid.


00:25:24.137 --> 00:25:25.136
- No name here.


00:25:25.138 --> 00:25:27.938
- That's my bag!
- Yeah, sure.


00:25:27.940 --> 00:25:29.774
An orc with an elf alchemy bag.


00:25:29.776 --> 00:25:33.110
- Who'd you steal it from?
Did you rough him up?


00:25:33.112 --> 00:25:35.012
- Did you hurt him real bad?


00:25:35.014 --> 00:25:36.480
- Step on him?


00:25:36.482 --> 00:25:37.281
- Uh, no.


00:25:37.283 --> 00:25:40.317
- Did you eat him?
- Why would I...no!


00:25:40.319 --> 00:25:41.852
- Here! Grab his wallet!


00:25:41.854 --> 00:25:42.853
- Got it!
- Hey!


00:25:42.855 --> 00:25:44.021
- Hey, throw it here, Scrap!


00:25:44.023 --> 00:25:47.491
- That was a gift
from my brother!


00:25:47.493 --> 00:25:51.929
- Okay, kid.
Get your wallet back.


00:25:52.498 --> 00:25:53.297
- What? How?


00:25:53.299 --> 00:25:58.102
- Here's your magic elf bag
that you didn't steal.


00:26:00.006 --> 00:26:02.106
- Hey! The bag opened up!
- Whoa!


00:26:02.108 --> 00:26:07.311
- Remember the spells.
Remember the spells.


00:26:07.313 --> 00:26:12.416
Metalopolus...
liquifyingnatous...


00:26:12.418 --> 00:26:15.586
bendtricular...plassie....


00:26:15.588 --> 00:26:17.888
- I think he's
talking gibberish.


00:26:17.890 --> 00:26:21.158
Should I call a doctor?


00:26:21.160 --> 00:26:22.893
- Whoa!


00:26:22.895 --> 00:26:24.562
He's going through metal!


00:26:26.265 --> 00:26:29.300
- Whoa!
I remember things.


00:26:29.302 --> 00:26:31.502
- I'm impressed.
Grab a seat.


00:26:31.504 --> 00:26:33.571
I gotta make a call.


00:26:33.573 --> 00:26:34.605
- Hey, sit down.


00:26:34.607 --> 00:26:38.242
So what's an orc doing
with a magic bag?


00:26:38.244 --> 00:26:39.977
- Uh, magic?


00:26:39.979 --> 00:26:42.146
- Huh, you're funny.


00:26:42.148 --> 00:26:44.381
- I...I don't get it.


00:26:44.383 --> 00:26:47.218
- I've, uh, been
studying for years.


00:26:47.220 --> 00:26:48.385
I'm like a big deal in my town.


00:26:48.387 --> 00:26:51.922
I'm practically going
to Krune University.


00:26:51.924 --> 00:26:54.124
- Krune University!


00:26:54.126 --> 00:26:56.927
- Yeah. You heard of it?
- No.


00:26:56.929 --> 00:26:57.428
- Ugh!


00:26:57.430 --> 00:27:01.131
- Well, it's the best school in
the world and I'm going there!


00:27:01.133 --> 00:27:03.934
Because I'm like a big deal.


00:27:03.936 --> 00:27:06.937
I'll all humble about it,
you know.


00:27:06.939 --> 00:27:08.072
- Blow something up!


00:27:08.074 --> 00:27:11.308
- Really? No one has ever wanted
me to blow something up.


00:27:11.310 --> 00:27:14.979
- What are you talking about?
You're an orc!


00:27:14.981 --> 00:27:16.347
- I was raised in Elfdale.


00:27:16.349 --> 00:27:19.884
- Elfdale?
What'd you do that for?


00:27:19.886 --> 00:27:21.185
- What is that?


00:27:21.187 --> 00:27:23.120
- He thinks he's an elf.


00:27:23.122 --> 00:27:25.155
- I do not!
I'm an orc!


00:27:25.157 --> 00:27:28.158
- Okay, orc.
Get a soda.


00:27:28.160 --> 00:27:30.294
- Huh.


00:27:30.296 --> 00:27:31.996
Yoo-hoo! Ma'am?


00:27:31.998 --> 00:27:37.935
- That's what an elf would do,
and stop calling women ma'am.


00:27:37.937 --> 00:27:40.237
An orc would just take it.


00:27:40.239 --> 00:27:43.574
- What? Why? That's...


00:27:46.379 --> 00:27:48.012
- Delicious!
- Huh?


00:27:48.014 --> 00:27:51.649
- Okay, elf-orc, do another
trick and use your bag.


00:27:51.651 --> 00:27:54.985
- I don't know. I really wanna
blow something up, but...


00:27:54.987 --> 00:27:59.089
- You wouldn't want me to get
all orc on you, would you?


00:27:59.091 --> 00:28:01.392
- Ah!


00:28:05.064 --> 00:28:06.697
- What's he doing?


00:28:06.699 --> 00:28:09.400
- Hand me your burger.


00:28:09.969 --> 00:28:12.236
Try it, unless you're afraid.


00:28:12.238 --> 00:28:13.537
- I'm afraid of nothin'!


00:28:13.539 --> 00:28:15.606
- That's right, Heap!


00:28:18.010 --> 00:28:19.510
Hah!


00:28:19.979 --> 00:28:24.515
Being an orc is all about
proving you're strong.


00:28:24.517 --> 00:28:27.151
- I'm strong!
Super strong!


00:28:27.153 --> 00:28:29.353
My friends think
I'm the strongest.


00:28:29.355 --> 00:28:32.723
- Ain't takin'
no heat from anyone!


00:28:32.725 --> 00:28:34.258
- I'm the heatiest one ever!


00:28:34.260 --> 00:28:36.293
That's what everyone says!


00:28:36.295 --> 00:28:38.696
- Ugh...


00:28:38.698 --> 00:28:39.563
- Hey, boss.


00:28:39.565 --> 00:28:41.465
I got what you're looking for.


00:28:41.467 --> 00:28:44.435
Orc's got an elf bag
and knows how to use it.


00:28:44.437 --> 00:28:48.472
Put his hand right
through a napkin holder.


00:28:49.442 --> 00:28:53.310
We'll get him to you.
No worries.


00:29:01.721 --> 00:29:03.253
- Ugh!


00:29:06.292 --> 00:29:08.292
Barl?


00:29:32.418 --> 00:29:33.484
Barl.


00:29:33.486 --> 00:29:36.353
- Shh! Shh!
Here she comes.


00:29:38.057 --> 00:29:40.257
- Huh?


00:29:42.028 --> 00:29:44.628
- Hey, get outta here!


00:29:46.198 --> 00:29:47.531
- Too loud!


00:29:47.533 --> 00:29:49.533
Eddy don't like!


00:29:49.535 --> 00:29:50.634
Out!


00:29:50.636 --> 00:29:54.171
- Let's go, let's go!
- Out!


00:29:54.173 --> 00:29:55.272
- Come on, Barl!


00:29:55.274 --> 00:29:57.408
You're a Big Tooth Chomper now!


00:29:57.410 --> 00:30:00.577
We have another
Big Tooth Chomper!


00:30:01.313 --> 00:30:03.547
- Hey, there you are.


00:30:03.549 --> 00:30:04.248
Jeez!


00:30:04.250 --> 00:30:06.083
You call this getting ice?
Come on.


00:30:06.085 --> 00:30:09.653
Let's go back in the motel
so we can...


00:30:09.655 --> 00:30:12.723
- Hey, you know this little elf?


00:30:12.725 --> 00:30:14.258
- Nope.


00:30:14.527 --> 00:30:17.161
He was just giving me
a ride out of town,


00:30:17.163 --> 00:30:19.797
but I found a new ride.


00:30:20.599 --> 00:30:22.366
- Barl!


00:30:22.368 --> 00:30:24.401
- Hmm.


00:30:38.350 --> 00:30:41.652
- Hey, they have
the same statue in Elfdale!


00:30:41.654 --> 00:30:42.719
Only this elf has the gem!


00:30:42.721 --> 00:30:47.091
- Figures! Elves think
they're better than everyone!


00:30:47.093 --> 00:30:51.261
- They sure do,
especially brothers.


00:31:24.830 --> 00:31:26.196
- Where are we?


00:31:26.198 --> 00:31:29.733
- This is
Big Tooth Chomper Central.


00:31:29.735 --> 00:31:36.874
- Hey, the new guy doesn't think
much of our luxury...accomahd?


00:31:36.876 --> 00:31:38.375
Acroma?


00:31:38.377 --> 00:31:39.810
He thinks our place sucks.


00:31:39.812 --> 00:31:42.546
- Well, I didn't say that.


00:31:42.548 --> 00:31:47.284
I mean, yeah, I did say that.
You got a problem?


00:31:47.286 --> 00:31:48.285
- And what if I did?


00:31:48.287 --> 00:31:53.423
- Then I'll do to you what
I did to the napkin holder.


00:31:56.195 --> 00:31:58.395
- Schwartz!
Let's get moving!


00:31:58.397 --> 00:32:01.765
- You see that?
It ain't too tough to be tough.


00:32:01.767 --> 00:32:05.169
You'll be riding
with us soon enough.


00:32:05.171 --> 00:32:08.772
- Who said that runt
can ride with me?


00:32:08.774 --> 00:32:10.240
- Uh, not me.


00:32:10.242 --> 00:32:12.543
- Rolf, I didn't mean anything.


00:32:12.545 --> 00:32:15.412
But I think
you should meet the new guy.


00:32:15.414 --> 00:32:18.248
- Who's this runt?


00:32:18.250 --> 00:32:19.883
Smells like an elf!


00:32:19.885 --> 00:32:23.720
- Yeah. This is the kid
I told you about, Rolf,


00:32:23.722 --> 00:32:25.189
the orc with the elf bag.


00:32:25.191 --> 00:32:29.259
- He knows how
to use them spells, Rolf.


00:32:29.261 --> 00:32:32.396
- I don't like his face.
It's soft.


00:32:32.398 --> 00:32:36.433
- Well, you're ugly and your
breath smells like feet!


00:32:41.507 --> 00:32:43.407
- You've got guts, runt!


00:32:43.409 --> 00:32:47.444
Mush for brains,
but plenty of guts.


00:32:47.446 --> 00:32:48.245
Fine.


00:32:48.247 --> 00:32:49.713
You can run with the War Chief


00:32:49.715 --> 00:32:51.448
until I get sick
of looking at you.


00:32:51.450 --> 00:32:54.918
- Oh, that's great, Rolf!
I told you he was one of us.


00:32:54.920 --> 00:33:00.290
- Let me see the bag.
- Hey, give it back!


00:33:02.628 --> 00:33:04.328
- Won't open.


00:33:04.330 --> 00:33:08.398
You lied to me, all of you!


00:33:08.400 --> 00:33:10.667
You know what I do to liars!


00:33:10.669 --> 00:33:13.770
- Wait!
Only Barl can open it up.


00:33:13.772 --> 00:33:15.939
- Open it!


00:33:23.249 --> 00:33:24.982
- Phew.


00:33:24.984 --> 00:33:27.751
- Now do some elf magic!


00:33:27.753 --> 00:33:29.853
- Technically, it's orc magic.


00:33:29.855 --> 00:33:32.256
- Technically,
I'm gonna make you into


00:33:32.258 --> 00:33:34.691
a Christmas ornament
if you don't shut up!


00:33:34.693 --> 00:33:38.495
- Heap, shh!
Barl needs to concentrate!


00:33:38.497 --> 00:33:40.364
- What's taking so long?


00:33:40.366 --> 00:33:42.866
- It's empty.


00:33:42.868 --> 00:33:45.702
- Empty?
Empty?


00:33:45.704 --> 00:33:48.839
- Wait!
We can refill it, right?


00:33:48.841 --> 00:33:52.509
You said you just need
the right ingredients.


00:33:52.511 --> 00:33:53.710
- Yes! I mean, absolutely!


00:33:53.712 --> 00:33:55.712
I just need the right
ingredients.


00:33:55.714 --> 00:33:57.614
- We can take him out shopping.


00:33:57.616 --> 00:33:58.415
- Fine.


00:33:58.417 --> 00:34:02.352
Take these three morons
and go shopping...


00:34:02.354 --> 00:34:04.321
orc style.


00:34:04.323 --> 00:34:05.389
- Very wise, sir.


00:34:05.391 --> 00:34:09.293
- Cool! Orc style.
I like the sound of that.


00:34:09.295 --> 00:34:11.628
- Walk with me.


00:34:11.630 --> 00:34:12.296
- But...


00:34:12.298 --> 00:34:15.065
- Don't worry.
You'll catch up.


00:34:18.470 --> 00:34:23.473
- Yeah, so what do you need
to see me about, Rolf?


00:34:23.475 --> 00:34:24.308
I mean, I...


00:34:24.310 --> 00:34:27.077
- You sure that runt can
grab stuff through metal?


00:34:27.079 --> 00:34:28.045
- Oh, I'm sure.


00:34:28.047 --> 00:34:30.714
I never seen an orc with
a magic elf bag before.


00:34:30.716 --> 00:34:33.717
- That's good news for you
and the gang, Thomble.


00:34:33.719 --> 00:34:38.488
This runt needs to get all
that magic stuff by tonight.


00:34:38.490 --> 00:34:39.456
- No problem, boss.


00:34:39.458 --> 00:34:42.759
What's going on tonight?
You throwing a party?


00:34:42.761 --> 00:34:44.728
- No! Revenge!


00:34:44.730 --> 00:34:47.664
Total and complete revenge!


00:34:47.666 --> 00:34:49.499
- With who? The runt?


00:34:49.501 --> 00:34:50.667
- Huh? What?


00:34:50.669 --> 00:34:52.436
The runt? Why?


00:34:52.438 --> 00:34:53.337
No, you fool!


00:34:53.339 --> 00:34:56.540
A thousand years ago,
our ancestors lost


00:34:56.542 --> 00:35:02.045
what was rightfully ours:
complete orc domination!


00:35:02.047 --> 00:35:02.779
- What?


00:35:02.781 --> 00:35:05.415
I thought we were
in peace with the elves.


00:35:05.417 --> 00:35:06.116
- Peace?


00:35:06.118 --> 00:35:10.654
Look at us!
Does this look like peace?


00:35:10.656 --> 00:35:12.356
- Uh, no.


00:35:12.358 --> 00:35:13.824
- How could
we live in peace


00:35:13.826 --> 00:35:15.892
when the elves have
all the magic?


00:35:15.894 --> 00:35:18.862
How could we live in peace
when they live


00:35:18.864 --> 00:35:24.801
in happy, shiny Elfdale and
we live in dirt and rocks?


00:35:24.803 --> 00:35:27.371
- Yeah, but I love
dirt and rocks.


00:35:27.373 --> 00:35:29.773
I mean, I hate dirt and rocks.


00:35:29.775 --> 00:35:33.643
They're horrible, they're dirty
and rocky.


00:35:33.645 --> 00:35:35.712
- Make the magic bag
work, Thomble,


00:35:35.714 --> 00:35:40.684
And you and the gang will be in
command of the new orc world!


00:35:40.686 --> 00:35:43.820
Together, me as your leader,


00:35:43.822 --> 00:35:45.789
we can steal
the power


00:35:45.791 --> 00:35:49.426
that ended a war
a thousand years ago!


00:35:49.428 --> 00:35:52.396
- Uh, what power?


00:35:52.398 --> 00:35:53.997
How?


00:35:53.999 --> 00:35:56.900
- Here, buried in this statue,


00:35:56.902 --> 00:36:01.438
the gemstone that ended
the war was cast.


00:36:01.440 --> 00:36:02.672
- Oh!


00:36:02.674 --> 00:36:05.142
So the orc
with the magic elf bag


00:36:05.144 --> 00:36:08.812
can use his magic stuff
and get through the metal.


00:36:08.814 --> 00:36:13.083
Like pulling his wallet out
of a napkin holder.


00:36:13.085 --> 00:36:15.051
- Huh? Like what?


00:36:15.053 --> 00:36:17.587
Napkin holder?
What are you...


00:36:17.589 --> 00:36:20.123
- Oh, right!
I see it now, boss!


00:36:20.125 --> 00:36:23.994
Barl can get
into the statue with his magic


00:36:23.996 --> 00:36:25.429
and grab the gemstone!


00:36:25.431 --> 00:36:27.063
And then we'll all be Kings!


00:36:27.065 --> 00:36:31.701
- I'll be the King,
you imbecile!


00:36:33.439 --> 00:36:35.839
But it's not so easy.


00:36:35.841 --> 00:36:37.808
We orcs have one-half


00:36:37.810 --> 00:36:40.911
and the other half
is in Elfdale!


00:36:40.913 --> 00:36:42.746
- Well, that blows.


00:36:42.748 --> 00:36:44.815
So much for winning
the other half.


00:36:44.817 --> 00:36:48.485
- But with both halves,
together,


00:36:48.487 --> 00:36:51.621
we can start a new world,


00:36:51.623 --> 00:36:55.692
a word dominated by orcs!


00:36:55.694 --> 00:37:00.764
- Orc, orc, orc, orc, orc, orc!


00:37:00.766 --> 00:37:02.833
Yeah!


00:37:04.536 --> 00:37:05.469
- Go.


00:37:05.471 --> 00:37:08.572
- Yeah!
Right on, boss!


00:37:14.580 --> 00:37:16.146
- I'm done looking after you.


00:37:16.148 --> 00:37:19.983
You wanna run away?
Fine! Good riddance!


00:37:19.985 --> 00:37:21.918
Run away!


00:37:23.622 --> 00:37:25.222
I'm better off
without you anyway.


00:37:25.224 --> 00:37:26.490
I'll go back to school.


00:37:26.492 --> 00:37:30.160
I'll deliver my incredibly
awesome speech at graduation.


00:37:30.162 --> 00:37:32.262
I'll go to Krune University


00:37:32.264 --> 00:37:34.831
and never see you again,


00:37:34.833 --> 00:37:39.970
never be your big...
brother...again!


00:37:41.940 --> 00:37:43.874
Gnome biscuits!


00:37:51.617 --> 00:37:55.018
- Hello, young man.
Can I help you?


00:37:55.020 --> 00:37:57.153
- I need to purchase
some moon dew.


00:37:57.155 --> 00:38:00.056
- Uh, how much do you need?


00:38:00.058 --> 00:38:01.925
- Two jars.


00:38:01.927 --> 00:38:05.128
- That's a lot of moon dew.


00:38:05.130 --> 00:38:07.264
It'll be pretty expensive.


00:38:07.266 --> 00:38:10.033
- Oh, hold on. Scrap?


00:38:10.035 --> 00:38:12.836
- You havin' trouble?


00:38:12.838 --> 00:38:14.304
- Yeah, what's the problem?


00:38:14.306 --> 00:38:17.207
- No problem.
Mr. Hodges...


00:38:17.209 --> 00:38:18.208
- What? Me?


00:38:18.210 --> 00:38:20.877
- ...was saying the moon
dew we need is expensive.


00:38:20.879 --> 00:38:23.680
Do you have any money?
I only have a few dollars.


00:38:23.682 --> 00:38:25.549
- I thought we had
a discount here.


00:38:25.551 --> 00:38:32.022
- Oh, of course, Mr. Thomble,
your discount.


00:38:33.759 --> 00:38:35.792
- How much is it
with the discount?


00:38:35.794 --> 00:38:37.327
- It's on the house.


00:38:37.329 --> 00:38:40.630
- Barl, just accept
the man's gift.


00:38:40.632 --> 00:38:41.798
- Thank you, Mr. Hodges.


00:38:41.800 --> 00:38:43.133
- I don't want any trouble now.


00:38:43.135 --> 00:38:46.236
I run a respectable
business here.


00:38:46.238 --> 00:38:48.038
- You's have a good day.


00:38:48.040 --> 00:38:49.639
- Oh, thanks.


00:38:49.641 --> 00:38:51.875
- Wow! Orcs are really nice.


00:38:51.877 --> 00:38:55.579
- Yeah, sure, kid.
Sweet as daisies.


00:38:55.581 --> 00:38:59.849
- Hop on, Barl.
Let's get this next ingredient.


00:38:59.851 --> 00:39:03.153
- I was saying we're having a...


00:39:03.155 --> 00:39:06.289
sale on goblin vine today.


00:39:06.291 --> 00:39:09.693
And you can just have it.


00:39:09.695 --> 00:39:10.794
We have too much of it anyway.


00:39:10.796 --> 00:39:13.029
- Hey! No! No!
- It's such a good ingredient.


00:39:13.031 --> 00:39:16.766
- Yep. Sure is!
Well, enjoy.


00:39:16.768 --> 00:39:18.768
We're closing early today!


00:39:18.770 --> 00:39:20.804
- Bad plant, bad plant!
No! Stop!


00:39:20.806 --> 00:39:24.007
- That's the second store
that's given us a deal today.


00:39:24.009 --> 00:39:26.142
Is that right?
Feels weird.


00:39:26.144 --> 00:39:28.078
- Don't worry about it, Barl.


00:39:28.080 --> 00:39:30.080
Just... Are you getting
what you need?


00:39:30.082 --> 00:39:32.282
- Oh, yeah.
Just one and it should be great.


00:39:32.284 --> 00:39:37.754
- And what's that?
- Air crystals.


00:39:40.692 --> 00:39:45.128
- Hey, what are you doing?
Ow!


00:39:52.170 --> 00:39:54.070
- Excuse me.


00:39:55.007 --> 00:39:57.307
Have you seen this orc?


00:39:59.177 --> 00:40:03.046
Sorry. I didn't have a photo,
so I just drew this.


00:40:03.048 --> 00:40:05.281
But he looks like an orc.


00:40:05.283 --> 00:40:08.418
He's big like you


00:40:08.420 --> 00:40:12.956
with big hands...
like you.


00:40:12.958 --> 00:40:15.158
But you seem angrier.


00:40:24.136 --> 00:40:26.703
Well, hey there.
You look familiar.


00:40:26.705 --> 00:40:29.272
- You ever seen anything
like that before?


00:40:29.274 --> 00:40:31.374
- We have the same
statue in Elfdale.


00:40:31.376 --> 00:40:34.110
- Statue?
No, you silly elf.


00:40:34.112 --> 00:40:36.680
This hot dog.
Relish its beauty.


00:40:36.682 --> 00:40:42.752
Be a wiener and enjoy the taste
of this delectable treat.


00:40:42.754 --> 00:40:43.420
Hot buns?


00:40:43.422 --> 00:40:48.124
- You can't... look,
I'm trying to find my brother.


00:40:48.126 --> 00:40:50.160
- Hmm.


00:40:51.697 --> 00:40:54.364
I see things around here.


00:40:54.366 --> 00:40:56.766
- Have you seen my brother?


00:40:57.269 --> 00:40:58.301
- Hmm.


00:40:58.303 --> 00:41:00.470
Ah. Oh.


00:41:00.472 --> 00:41:02.772
Two dollars and
I'll tell you everything.


00:41:02.774 --> 00:41:08.211
And if you make it a dollar
more, I'll throw in a hot dog.


00:41:09.081 --> 00:41:11.748
Two dollars, no hot dog.


00:41:11.750 --> 00:41:13.850
Nope. Haven't seen him.


00:41:13.852 --> 00:41:17.487
- Wait! Look again, please?


00:41:19.124 --> 00:41:22.392
- Hmm.


00:41:22.394 --> 00:41:23.393
Twins?


00:41:23.395 --> 00:41:26.763
- What? No!
I'm an elf.


00:41:26.765 --> 00:41:27.831
He's an orc.


00:41:27.833 --> 00:41:29.232
- Fraternity brothers?


00:41:29.234 --> 00:41:30.300
- We're in high school.


00:41:30.302 --> 00:41:31.868
- You're not really brothers,
are you?


00:41:31.870 --> 00:41:34.871
This is a setup?
I'm being punked?


00:41:34.873 --> 00:41:35.872
Where are the cameras?


00:41:35.874 --> 00:41:38.842
I knew I was destined
to be a movie star.


00:41:38.844 --> 00:41:40.477
- No! He was adopted!


00:41:40.479 --> 00:41:43.313
He's my brother, but adopted.


00:41:43.315 --> 00:41:46.116
- Oh, why didn't you say so?


00:41:46.118 --> 00:41:49.419
Oh, yeah.
I see the resemblance now.


00:41:49.421 --> 00:41:55.291
- Never mind.
You obviously have not seen him.


00:41:55.293 --> 00:41:58.094
- Do you want another hot dog?


00:41:58.096 --> 00:42:00.830
Wait!


00:42:00.832 --> 00:42:03.099
You want any napkins?


00:42:03.101 --> 00:42:05.435
- Is this a joke to you?


00:42:05.437 --> 00:42:07.504
Is that what being an orc is?


00:42:07.506 --> 00:42:08.438
Laughing at others?


00:42:08.440 --> 00:42:10.206
Being mean?
Doing pranks?


00:42:10.208 --> 00:42:12.475
I need to find my brother.


00:42:12.477 --> 00:42:13.276
He ran away!


00:42:13.278 --> 00:42:15.245
- Look, kid, I don't
know where he's at.


00:42:15.247 --> 00:42:20.450
But he's lucky he has a brother
like you looking out for him.


00:42:22.487 --> 00:42:24.521
Ooh, I hit a nerve.


00:42:24.523 --> 00:42:26.422
Were you responsible for him?


00:42:26.424 --> 00:42:29.025
Are you feeling guilty now?


00:42:29.027 --> 00:42:29.993
Is that it?


00:42:29.995 --> 00:42:32.562
- What? No.
Why would you...


00:42:32.564 --> 00:42:33.530
- You're sweating.


00:42:33.532 --> 00:42:38.234
Here's a drink with
that hot dog... on the house.


00:42:44.576 --> 00:42:45.441
Look, elf.


00:42:45.443 --> 00:42:49.312
Orcs grow fast and
we're strong even as kids.


00:42:49.314 --> 00:42:52.115
It's hard for other people
to understand that.


00:42:52.117 --> 00:42:55.919
- I made a mistake
and now he ran away!


00:42:55.921 --> 00:42:58.922
- You're brothers,
and brothers fight.


00:42:58.924 --> 00:43:02.058
They make up, they fight again.


00:43:02.060 --> 00:43:03.193
You'll find him.


00:43:03.195 --> 00:43:04.961
And when you do,
you'll have a nice moment,


00:43:04.963 --> 00:43:07.897
maybe even hug it out
until the next time.


00:43:07.899 --> 00:43:11.134
- You know what?
This is a very good hot dog.


00:43:11.136 --> 00:43:13.036
- I know.


00:43:13.038 --> 00:43:16.105
- Welcome to Vrax's.
Can I help you?


00:43:16.107 --> 00:43:19.943
- Hello. I need a dozen of
your finest air crystals.


00:43:19.945 --> 00:43:21.511
- Oh, that's a tall order.


00:43:21.513 --> 00:43:24.147
How are you gonna be paying?


00:43:24.149 --> 00:43:27.016
- Um, discount?


00:43:27.018 --> 00:43:28.218
- Sorry, little dude.


00:43:28.220 --> 00:43:30.286
There is no discount
for air crystals.


00:43:30.288 --> 00:43:35.158
We import them from Goblin Town.
Very expensive.


00:43:35.160 --> 00:43:37.293
- I said discount.


00:43:37.295 --> 00:43:39.162
- And I said no!


00:43:39.164 --> 00:43:42.498
Besides, shouldn't you be
in school or something?


00:43:42.500 --> 00:43:46.269
- There you are.
Did you get the crystals?


00:43:46.271 --> 00:43:50.273
- Well, I
said discount, wink,


00:43:50.275 --> 00:43:53.142
and he said no, wink.


00:43:53.144 --> 00:43:56.546
- Oh, did he now?


00:43:56.548 --> 00:43:59.315
Wait outside.


00:43:59.317 --> 00:44:02.552
- Um, you can't
just come into my store


00:44:02.554 --> 00:44:03.519
and demand with a wink...


00:44:03.521 --> 00:44:06.556
- I can replace air crystals
with water bugs, easy.


00:44:06.558 --> 00:44:10.593
Don't...
- Wait outside.


00:44:10.595 --> 00:44:13.463
- Sorry?


00:44:21.172 --> 00:44:22.538
- Barl?


00:44:22.540 --> 00:44:25.041
Where are you going?


00:44:25.176 --> 00:44:28.311
- Hey, I got your crystals!


00:44:28.313 --> 00:44:30.346
- Barl just ran off!


00:44:30.348 --> 00:44:32.282
What did you do in there?


00:44:32.284 --> 00:44:33.650
- I got the discount.


00:44:33.652 --> 00:44:38.288
- Oh! You don't have
to be such an orc!


00:44:38.290 --> 00:44:41.658
- What are you doing getting
into trouble like this?


00:44:41.660 --> 00:44:44.093
What were you thinking?


00:44:44.095 --> 00:44:45.595
Mom's gonna kill me!


00:44:45.597 --> 00:44:47.096
Dad's gonna kill me!


00:44:47.098 --> 00:44:48.331
Everyone's gonna...


00:44:48.333 --> 00:44:49.933
- Barl! Barl?


00:44:49.935 --> 00:44:51.434
- Lloyd? Lloyd!


00:44:51.436 --> 00:44:53.269
- Get in the car! Now!


00:44:53.271 --> 00:44:56.139
- Hey! Hey, I thought
we were gonna hug,


00:44:56.141 --> 00:44:58.041
you know, like a big moment!


00:44:58.043 --> 00:44:58.574
- What?


00:44:58.576 --> 00:45:01.444
- Because you missed me and
you figured out you were wrong.


00:45:01.446 --> 00:45:03.613
- Wrong?
I wasn't wrong!


00:45:03.615 --> 00:45:05.648
- Is that why you came back?
To tell me that?


00:45:05.650 --> 00:45:09.319
- I came back because
you ran off with strangers!


00:45:09.321 --> 00:45:11.087
- So you're kidnapping me again?


00:45:11.089 --> 00:45:13.356
- I set up a hotel
for you to be in.


00:45:13.358 --> 00:45:16.726
You'll stay there
until after I graduate.


00:45:16.728 --> 00:45:17.994
- This elf again?


00:45:17.996 --> 00:45:20.496
- I'm his brother!
We're brothers!


00:45:20.498 --> 00:45:25.001
- Is that true?
He's your family?


00:45:25.003 --> 00:45:26.703
- Mm-hmm.


00:45:26.705 --> 00:45:30.974
- You said you didn't
have a home!


00:45:30.976 --> 00:45:35.111
- He does.
It's in Elfdale.


00:45:35.113 --> 00:45:38.715
- Sorry, Scrap.
I should go back with Lloyd now.


00:45:38.717 --> 00:45:41.384
- Rolf isn't gonna
just let you go.


00:45:41.386 --> 00:45:42.518
You know that, right?


00:45:42.520 --> 00:45:45.188
- Well, maybe
if you tell him nicely?


00:45:45.190 --> 00:45:46.356
- It doesn't work that way.


00:45:46.358 --> 00:45:51.394
- Look, Scrap, I think you're
one of the coolest people ever.


00:45:51.396 --> 00:45:54.664
You're funny,
you're smart and...


00:45:54.666 --> 00:45:55.732
but those other guys...


00:45:55.734 --> 00:46:00.236
- Careful, Barl!
That's my family!


00:46:00.238 --> 00:46:02.071
- They're kind of mean.


00:46:02.073 --> 00:46:04.307
- Barl, it's time to go.


00:46:04.309 --> 00:46:05.208
- Well, well,


00:46:05.210 --> 00:46:09.212
look who I found on
the wrong side of the tracks.


00:46:09.214 --> 00:46:12.415
You're not taking Barl anywhere.


00:46:12.417 --> 00:46:13.649
- That's not your business.


00:46:13.651 --> 00:46:18.588
- Everything is
my business, elf.


00:46:20.258 --> 00:46:22.425
- Lloyd, meet Thomble and Heap.


00:46:22.427 --> 00:46:25.194
Oh, and that's Scrap.


00:46:25.196 --> 00:46:27.330
Gang, this is my brother, Lloyd.


00:46:27.332 --> 00:46:29.165
- Brother, huh?


00:46:29.167 --> 00:46:32.335
Oh, yeah, the magic elf.


00:46:32.337 --> 00:46:37.407
- Lasau illusion arcaniss:
Charir Drastrix!


00:46:38.109 --> 00:46:40.343
Wait.


00:46:40.345 --> 00:46:41.277
Where's my bag?


00:46:41.279 --> 00:46:45.214
- Missing something?
- Your brother took it first!


00:46:45.216 --> 00:46:46.482
- Barl?


00:46:46.484 --> 00:46:48.317
- I was gonna return it?


00:46:48.319 --> 00:46:51.320
- Really? You stole my bag?


00:46:51.322 --> 00:46:53.523
- Okay, touching moment.


00:46:53.525 --> 00:46:55.391
He betrays you, you betray him.


00:46:55.393 --> 00:46:58.294
Grab them both.
Bring 'em to Rolf.


00:46:58.296 --> 00:47:01.264
- Barl!
What are you doing?


00:47:02.200 --> 00:47:03.499
Thomble! Stop it!


00:47:03.501 --> 00:47:05.501
He's down! You got him!


00:47:05.503 --> 00:47:07.236
Was that necessary?


00:47:07.238 --> 00:47:08.071
- Absolutely!


00:47:08.073 --> 00:47:12.208
Look, as long as we have the
elf, he'll do what we tell him.


00:47:12.210 --> 00:47:16.412
Now grab him and
I'll go get Mr. Wizard.


00:47:21.352 --> 00:47:24.520
- I didn't order any
kidnappings today, did I?


00:47:24.522 --> 00:47:28.558
- Yeah, the kid tried to run
without doing his part.


00:47:28.560 --> 00:47:30.093
The elf is his brother.


00:47:30.095 --> 00:47:32.695
- His brother?
You're kidding.


00:47:32.697 --> 00:47:34.197
They don't look anything alike.


00:47:34.199 --> 00:47:36.232
- That's because I'm an orc
and he's an elf.


00:47:36.234 --> 00:47:40.269
- Barl was adopted.
He had a family all along.


00:47:40.271 --> 00:47:42.772
- Well, what should
we do with them?


00:47:49.848 --> 00:47:51.848
- Let my brother go.


00:47:51.850 --> 00:47:54.283
- Hey, shut that elf up!


00:47:55.854 --> 00:47:56.652
- Lloyd!


00:47:56.654 --> 00:47:59.755
- Listen, runt.
I'll let your brother go.


00:47:59.757 --> 00:48:01.424
- Really?
That's a relief.


00:48:01.426 --> 00:48:05.228
- But only after you take
your stupid elf bag of tricks


00:48:05.230 --> 00:48:10.399
and give me the power
to go through metal.


00:48:10.401 --> 00:48:12.368
- Really?
That's it?


00:48:12.370 --> 00:48:15.872
- Yep, then free to go.


00:48:15.874 --> 00:48:18.274
- And if I say no?


00:48:18.276 --> 00:48:21.444
- Your parents will have
to adopt two new kids!


00:48:21.446 --> 00:48:24.514
- He gets a new brother
and sister?


00:48:24.516 --> 00:48:26.716
Wow, you are set!


00:48:28.586 --> 00:48:29.752
- Shh!


00:48:29.754 --> 00:48:31.888
- Our boss is really nice.


00:48:31.890 --> 00:48:35.591
- Listen up!
Tonight's the big night!


00:48:35.593 --> 00:48:37.326
Get that magic spell to work


00:48:37.328 --> 00:48:42.331
and we can finally take back
our orc domination!


00:48:42.333 --> 00:48:44.634
Now get them outta my sight.


00:48:44.636 --> 00:48:47.370
- Yeah. What should we do
with the elf?


00:48:47.372 --> 00:48:50.439
- Throw the elf
in an empty storeroom.


00:48:50.441 --> 00:48:51.607
- Huh?


00:48:51.609 --> 00:48:53.676
- Put him to work and watch him.


00:48:53.678 --> 00:48:54.877
- Wait!
You should let Lloyd go!


00:48:54.879 --> 00:48:56.579
He needs to graduate!
He's really smart!


00:48:56.581 --> 00:48:59.682
- You're supposed to be
my toughest orc!


00:48:59.684 --> 00:49:00.483
- Boss, I, uh...


00:49:00.485 --> 00:49:02.518
- My whole
plan could've fallen apart!


00:49:02.520 --> 00:49:05.955
All you had to do was
watch the runt!


00:49:05.957 --> 00:49:08.191
- I fixed it.


00:49:08.193 --> 00:49:10.359
- Fixed it?


00:49:10.361 --> 00:49:12.929
Now we have a hostage!


00:49:12.931 --> 00:49:15.565
You're lucky I'm in a good mood!


00:49:15.567 --> 00:49:18.901
Try not to fix anything else!


00:49:20.505 --> 00:49:24.273
- Stop staring.
You're making me nervous.


00:49:25.843 --> 00:49:29.378
What?
Do I have a booger on me?


00:49:29.380 --> 00:49:31.581
- I don't get it, Barl.


00:49:31.583 --> 00:49:35.251
If you had a family,
why'd you leave a family?


00:49:35.253 --> 00:49:38.287
If I had a real family...


00:49:39.591 --> 00:49:40.756
I don't know,


00:49:40.758 --> 00:49:42.825
things would have
been different.


00:49:42.827 --> 00:49:46.862
- I didn't leave,
at least not by choice.


00:49:46.864 --> 00:49:51.634
Lloyd and I...
are just different.


00:49:51.636 --> 00:49:52.368
- Why?


00:49:52.370 --> 00:49:55.571
Because he's an elf
and you're an orc?


00:49:55.573 --> 00:49:57.940
- Yeah, something like that.


00:49:57.942 --> 00:49:59.742
- But you're not.


00:49:59.744 --> 00:50:02.545
- What? An orc?


00:50:02.547 --> 00:50:04.280
- Not really.


00:50:04.282 --> 00:50:04.947
- Look at me.


00:50:04.949 --> 00:50:08.384
I'm big, I'm clumsy, I'm loud.


00:50:08.386 --> 00:50:09.252
I'm an orc.


00:50:09.254 --> 00:50:11.988
- But you know magic
like the elves.


00:50:11.990 --> 00:50:14.857
- I know a few things, I guess.


00:50:14.859 --> 00:50:17.026
But only because Lloyd
has been saying


00:50:17.028 --> 00:50:20.263
those stupid spells
his whole life!


00:50:20.265 --> 00:50:21.998
So I kind of know them too.


00:50:22.000 --> 00:50:27.336
- You're kind of like
an elf and an orc.


00:50:27.872 --> 00:50:29.672
- I'm a e-orc?


00:50:29.674 --> 00:50:30.840
- We'll work on it.


00:50:30.842 --> 00:50:35.811
- Scrap, what did Rolf
mean by "Orc Domination"?


00:50:38.916 --> 00:50:40.383
Oh, it's done!


00:50:40.385 --> 00:50:43.019
And, look, I made it
into a goo.


00:50:43.021 --> 00:50:44.520
Anyone can use it!


00:50:44.522 --> 00:50:47.790
- I heard it ding.
Is it done?


00:50:47.792 --> 00:50:49.558
- All done.


00:50:52.797 --> 00:50:55.765
Oh, here. I wrote down
the spell incantation.


00:50:55.767 --> 00:50:57.900
It's pretty simple.


00:50:57.902 --> 00:51:00.002
Can I leave with my brother now?


00:51:00.004 --> 00:51:01.971
We need to get home.


00:51:01.973 --> 00:51:05.508
- Oh, this is your home now.


00:51:05.943 --> 00:51:07.476
- Rolf, no!


00:51:07.478 --> 00:51:09.412
He gave you the spell!


00:51:09.414 --> 00:51:11.847
Rolf, please don't do this!


00:51:18.990 --> 00:51:23.359
- The gem is in there.
Of course it is.


00:51:26.497 --> 00:51:29.665
- Well, what are
you waiting for?


00:51:31.336 --> 00:51:33.569
- Oh, man.


00:51:39.610 --> 00:51:42.411
- Oh, that's cold!


00:51:42.413 --> 00:51:44.814
- Hurry, you dweeb!


00:51:46.884 --> 00:51:48.417
- Mmm. okay...


00:51:48.419 --> 00:51:50.686
Metalopolus...


00:51:50.688 --> 00:51:53.989
liquifyingnatous...


00:51:53.991 --> 00:51:58.427
bendtricular...plastiqa...


00:51:58.896 --> 00:52:01.664
Cold...


00:52:03.868 --> 00:52:05.968
Oh, I'm in!


00:52:05.970 --> 00:52:06.936
- Good!


00:52:06.938 --> 00:52:09.939
Find the stone!
Find it!


00:52:10.508 --> 00:52:13.476
- I'm touching it.


00:52:16.147 --> 00:52:17.613
- Well?


00:52:17.615 --> 00:52:23.552
- Uh, it's just a rock.
You sure this is it?


00:52:23.554 --> 00:52:25.521
- Bring it to me!


00:52:25.523 --> 00:52:27.590
- Okay, fine.


00:52:27.592 --> 00:52:31.727
It looks like a rock.
Uh, here.


00:52:34.532 --> 00:52:39.769
- Totallus Controllus!


00:52:48.579 --> 00:52:52.782
Totallus Controllus!


00:52:53.050 --> 00:52:57.553
Totallus Controllus!


00:52:59.891 --> 00:53:01.924
- Um, you okay, boss?


00:53:01.926 --> 00:53:08.063
You seem... bigger.


00:53:08.065 --> 00:53:09.665
- Power!


00:53:09.667 --> 00:53:11.934
I feel incredible!


00:53:11.936 --> 00:53:15.871
- Yeah. So, boss, can I
feel incredible too?


00:53:15.873 --> 00:53:19.008
I'd really like to be...oh!


00:53:20.711 --> 00:53:22.611
- Hey, Thomble, you okay?


00:53:30.988 --> 00:53:33.622
- Go!
Bring others here!


00:53:33.624 --> 00:53:37.126
We need to build an orc army!


00:53:37.128 --> 00:53:41.730
We need to build my army!


00:53:43.668 --> 00:53:45.100
And then...


00:53:45.102 --> 00:53:49.538
we take the other
stone from Elfdale.


00:53:49.874 --> 00:53:54.109
This is the best night
of my life!


00:54:01.085 --> 00:54:03.085
- Hey!
- Huh?


00:54:03.087 --> 00:54:06.655
- Hello! Hi.
I gotta go.


00:54:06.657 --> 00:54:08.891
I'm gonna pee my pants.


00:54:09.927 --> 00:54:12.061
- I'm serious, man.
Please?


00:54:12.063 --> 00:54:14.830
I really gotta go.


00:54:14.832 --> 00:54:15.998
- Kids.


00:54:16.000 --> 00:54:18.801
How did you
get your gag out?


00:54:18.803 --> 00:54:23.506
- I'm serious! Please?
I really gotta go.


00:54:25.176 --> 00:54:26.942
- Huh?


00:54:26.944 --> 00:54:28.577
- Picus takeeus.


00:54:28.579 --> 00:54:30.846
- Hey!


00:54:43.861 --> 00:54:44.793
- You!
- You!


00:54:44.795 --> 00:54:46.295
How did you escape?


00:54:46.297 --> 00:54:48.731
- Appicus take--
Ow!


00:54:48.733 --> 00:54:49.798
What'd you do that for?


00:54:49.800 --> 00:54:53.102
- Because you were gonna turn me
into a squirrel or something!


00:54:53.104 --> 00:54:54.837
- I was gonna put you to sleep.


00:54:54.839 --> 00:54:55.838
That hurt, you know.


00:54:55.840 --> 00:54:57.973
- Well, don't use magic on me!


00:54:57.975 --> 00:55:00.843
- Fine.
Then don't head butt me.


00:55:00.845 --> 00:55:01.744
Now where's Barl?


00:55:01.746 --> 00:55:04.747
- I told him what
orc domination meant.


00:55:04.749 --> 00:55:08.017
- What do you mean,
orc domination?


00:55:08.019 --> 00:55:10.853
- Look, I know
this seems really bad.


00:55:10.855 --> 00:55:14.690
But I didn't think
we were really bad.


00:55:14.692 --> 00:55:18.193
Okay, you know how
orcs and elves


00:55:18.195 --> 00:55:22.331
lived in peace for 1,000 years?


00:55:22.333 --> 00:55:23.065
- And?


00:55:23.067 --> 00:55:26.635
- I just wanted a family!
I just wanted to belong!


00:55:26.637 --> 00:55:28.938
I didn't know
that Rolf wanted...


00:55:28.940 --> 00:55:31.240
- Scrap... What did you do?


00:55:31.242 --> 00:55:34.243
- Rolf used me.
He used your brother!


00:55:34.245 --> 00:55:37.279
Barl created a spell
to get a gemstone


00:55:37.281 --> 00:55:39.248
that would create an army!


00:55:39.250 --> 00:55:41.016
- Wait! What gemstone?


00:55:41.018 --> 00:55:45.020
- From the stories,
from our history,


00:55:45.022 --> 00:55:50.626
the battle between orcs
and elves 1,000 years ago?


00:55:50.861 --> 00:55:52.695
- Rolf knows where it is?


00:55:52.697 --> 00:55:53.295
Impossible.


00:55:53.297 --> 00:55:57.032
- He said he was the descendant
of the general orc


00:55:57.034 --> 00:55:58.767
that fought in the final battle.


00:55:58.769 --> 00:56:04.239
Secrets were passed to him
from generation to generation.


00:56:04.241 --> 00:56:05.641
- Wait a minute.


00:56:05.643 --> 00:56:08.677
Rolf is related to Shark Tooth?


00:56:08.679 --> 00:56:09.244
- Mm-hmm.


00:56:09.246 --> 00:56:11.714
- So if he has the stone,
then no one is safe.


00:56:11.716 --> 00:56:15.985
Legend has it that orcs became
10 times their normal size.


00:56:15.987 --> 00:56:16.986
And all of them were...


00:56:16.988 --> 00:56:19.688
- Controlled by
General Sharp Tooth.


00:56:19.690 --> 00:56:21.023
- You know your history.


00:56:21.025 --> 00:56:23.292
- Your brother is this way.


00:56:23.294 --> 00:56:24.827
Come on.


00:56:30.901 --> 00:56:33.736
See?
He's in a funk.


00:56:33.738 --> 00:56:38.173
- Hey, buddy...
you wanna go home?


00:56:38.175 --> 00:56:40.676
- Is it time for graduation?


00:56:40.678 --> 00:56:45.247
Oh, sorry about the whole
orc domination thing.


00:56:45.249 --> 00:56:46.649
My bad.


00:56:46.651 --> 00:56:52.254
- Barl, I know you didn't mean
for this to happen, okay?


00:56:52.723 --> 00:56:56.125
- Mom and Dad are gonna kill me.


00:56:56.227 --> 00:57:00.129
- I know you messed up,
but I messed up too.


00:57:00.131 --> 00:57:02.931
We all messed up!


00:57:02.933 --> 00:57:04.133
But, Barl, we are family!


00:57:04.135 --> 00:57:10.105
And as a family,
we're all gonna fix this, okay?


00:57:10.107 --> 00:57:10.839
- How?


00:57:10.841 --> 00:57:14.176
- Rolf needs the second half
of the gemstone


00:57:14.178 --> 00:57:15.210
to take full control.


00:57:15.212 --> 00:57:17.946
- We need to stop him
before that happens!


00:57:17.948 --> 00:57:18.981
- That's right.


00:57:18.983 --> 00:57:20.883
- Is it in the other statue?


00:57:20.885 --> 00:57:22.184
- Yes, in Elfdale!


00:57:22.186 --> 00:57:24.953
- We need to get to Elfdale
before Rolf does!


00:57:24.955 --> 00:57:28.857
- They're in here!
I can hear 'em!


00:57:28.859 --> 00:57:30.459
- Scrap, can you
get us out of here?


00:57:30.461 --> 00:57:32.928
- There's a window
on the bottom floor


00:57:32.930 --> 00:57:34.930
that doesn't latch properly.


00:57:34.932 --> 00:57:36.131
- Perfect.


00:57:36.133 --> 00:57:38.801
- You're not gonna
hurt them, are you?


00:57:38.803 --> 00:57:41.170
- Who?
- The Chompers!


00:57:41.172 --> 00:57:44.907
Bad guys or not,
they're my family!


00:57:44.909 --> 00:57:46.075
I mean, you are part orc.


00:57:46.077 --> 00:57:50.112
- Part e-orc? I'll make sure
we don't hurt them.


00:57:50.114 --> 00:57:51.413
Promise.


00:57:52.316 --> 00:57:55.184
- And they're over here!
I can hear 'em!


00:57:55.186 --> 00:57:56.852
- Oh, here's your bag.


00:57:56.854 --> 00:57:59.154
- Oh, there's goo inside!


00:57:59.156 --> 00:58:00.889
- Guys, the door!


00:58:00.891 --> 00:58:02.291
- Scrap! Open the door!


00:58:02.293 --> 00:58:03.992
- Wait!
- I can hear you!


00:58:03.994 --> 00:58:04.860
- I know a spell.


00:58:04.862 --> 00:58:10.332
Freezey peazy,
lemon squeezy!


00:58:12.937 --> 00:58:14.236
- I'm confused.


00:58:14.238 --> 00:58:15.504
- Follow me.


00:58:15.506 --> 00:58:17.139
- Here. Take your bag.


00:58:17.141 --> 00:58:17.940
- What was that?


00:58:17.942 --> 00:58:20.976
- I was trying out a spell
to freeze the door shut.


00:58:20.978 --> 00:58:24.346
- Leave the spells to me, okay?


00:58:24.348 --> 00:58:26.081
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.


00:58:28.753 --> 00:58:29.785
- There they are!


00:58:29.787 --> 00:58:32.020
- The floor is melting!


00:58:32.022 --> 00:58:33.255
What did you do?


00:58:33.257 --> 00:58:35.290
- Should have emptied the bag!


00:58:35.292 --> 00:58:37.126
- You need to stay
out of my bag!


00:58:37.128 --> 00:58:38.026
- That works, too.


00:58:38.028 --> 00:58:41.296
I think the building
is shrinking!


00:58:42.366 --> 00:58:44.933
- What kind of spell
was that, Burl?


00:58:44.935 --> 00:58:46.168
- In my defense,
that was supposed


00:58:46.170 --> 00:58:49.471
to freeze the door shut,
not melt the building.


00:58:51.008 --> 00:58:52.341
- What's that?


00:58:52.343 --> 00:58:53.275
- I got one spell wrong!


00:58:53.277 --> 00:58:55.043
- What else is melting?
- Jeez!


00:58:55.045 --> 00:58:57.079
That's not anything melting.


00:58:57.081 --> 00:58:59.815
- Those are footstomps!


00:59:07.224 --> 00:59:08.957
- We gotta get to Elfdale
right now!


00:59:08.959 --> 00:59:12.961
- We can take the motor...
never mind.


00:59:12.963 --> 00:59:15.898
- Lloyd, get your back!
- Look out!


00:59:15.900 --> 00:59:18.333
Heap, you're okay!


00:59:18.335 --> 00:59:21.036
Heap! Put him down!


00:59:21.038 --> 00:59:22.871
Heap, what are you doing?


00:59:22.873 --> 00:59:25.174
- That's not Heap anymore.


00:59:25.176 --> 00:59:26.008
- Help me!


00:59:26.010 --> 00:59:28.944
- Hang on, Lloyd!
We're coming to help you!


00:59:31.148 --> 00:59:32.548
- I'm sorry, Heap!


00:59:32.550 --> 00:59:35.050
- Better than mind control.


00:59:35.052 --> 00:59:36.552
- Thanks.


00:59:38.989 --> 00:59:40.055
- Duck!
- Look out!


00:59:40.057 --> 00:59:42.558
- I hoped that would
hold him longer.


00:59:43.127 --> 00:59:46.261
Hey! Let me go!
Put me down!


00:59:46.263 --> 00:59:46.929
- Scrap!


00:59:46.931 --> 00:59:50.432
- Barl, I don't wanna
be mind controlled!


00:59:50.434 --> 00:59:52.868
- Scrap!


00:59:52.870 --> 00:59:53.836
- Barl!


00:59:57.408 --> 00:59:59.308
- Get off of me!


00:59:59.877 --> 01:00:01.443
- Lloyd, help!


01:00:01.445 --> 01:00:03.412
- That's Rolf!


01:00:04.515 --> 01:00:05.981
What happened to Rolf?


01:00:05.983 --> 01:00:09.017
- Rolf!
Don't you mind control her!


01:00:09.019 --> 01:00:10.853
Don't you do it!


01:00:17.528 --> 01:00:21.396
- You both belong to me!


01:00:21.398 --> 01:00:23.632
- No!


01:00:25.102 --> 01:00:28.303
- Stop him before
he warns Elfdale!


01:00:32.977 --> 01:00:35.177
- Maximus Copius!


01:00:40.651 --> 01:00:41.450
This is bad.


01:00:41.452 --> 01:00:44.019
This is really, really,
really bad.


01:00:46.090 --> 01:00:48.357
Barl! Scrap!
Wait!


01:00:49.660 --> 01:00:51.927
This isn't you!


01:00:51.929 --> 01:00:53.629
Fight it!


01:00:54.064 --> 01:00:56.465
You need to break free.
Wait!


01:00:56.467 --> 01:00:58.233
Break!


01:01:02.473 --> 01:01:04.973
Enchantus Breakus!


01:01:13.117 --> 01:01:17.019
Oh, you're crushing me!


01:01:17.021 --> 01:01:18.287
Barl!


01:01:18.289 --> 01:01:19.354
- Lloyd!


01:01:19.356 --> 01:01:21.456
- Oh, my head.


01:01:21.458 --> 01:01:23.058
- What did you do?


01:01:23.060 --> 01:01:24.459
- I broke the enchantment!


01:01:24.461 --> 01:01:26.995
I cannot believe
that just worked!


01:01:26.997 --> 01:01:28.563
- Was I hugging you?


01:01:28.565 --> 01:01:30.699
Because that would be so weird.


01:01:30.701 --> 01:01:33.201
- You were actually
trying to kill me.


01:01:33.203 --> 01:01:35.270
- Oh, that makes way more sense!


01:01:35.272 --> 01:01:36.238
Look we need to hurry.


01:01:36.240 --> 01:01:40.042
Rolf's gonna have all those
zombie orcs attack Elfdale!


01:01:40.044 --> 01:01:42.711
- Can't you do
that break enchantment thing


01:01:42.713 --> 01:01:43.645
on the rest of them?


01:01:43.647 --> 01:01:45.380
- I used the last of
my magic on you two.


01:01:45.382 --> 01:01:46.248
I need to rest.


01:01:46.250 --> 01:01:49.551
- And Rolf could just
mind control us again.


01:01:50.054 --> 01:01:53.088
Whoa!
You've never let me drive!


01:01:53.090 --> 01:01:55.457
- Like I said, I need a rest.


01:01:55.459 --> 01:01:58.093
- No, "don't scratch it?".


01:01:58.095 --> 01:02:03.031
"Drive the speed limit.
Be careful."


01:02:03.033 --> 01:02:04.666
- Barl, I trust you.


01:02:04.668 --> 01:02:05.701
Now get us to Elfdale.


01:02:05.703 --> 01:02:09.037
- Cool!
I call back seat, junkhead.


01:02:35.432 --> 01:02:39.234
- I... uh... I don't...


01:02:40.104 --> 01:02:41.370
I, uh, I don't get it.


01:02:41.372 --> 01:02:44.106
- I wasn't gonna hit
that little bunny!


01:02:44.108 --> 01:02:45.607
- It was a cute bunny.


01:02:45.609 --> 01:02:46.608
- A little cute bunny.


01:02:46.610 --> 01:02:49.478
- My car is upside down
on top of a tree!


01:02:49.480 --> 01:02:53.181
- Yes, and a cute little
fluffy bunny is alive,


01:02:53.183 --> 01:02:54.649
thanks to my very good driving.


01:02:54.651 --> 01:02:58.520
- Can't you whip up
a spell or something?


01:02:58.522 --> 01:03:01.089
- Tree! Car!


01:03:01.091 --> 01:03:03.792
- You're not being very helpful.


01:03:05.062 --> 01:03:06.094
- Wait! Shh!


01:03:06.096 --> 01:03:08.530
Do you two hear that?


01:03:08.532 --> 01:03:10.632
- Oh, no!


01:03:11.702 --> 01:03:13.568
- Is that Rolf?


01:03:13.570 --> 01:03:16.405
- We have to get outta here.


01:03:19.143 --> 01:03:20.509
- No, we don't.


01:03:26.417 --> 01:03:29.618
- Lloyd?
Barl? Is that you?


01:03:29.620 --> 01:03:30.318
- Sophie!


01:03:30.320 --> 01:03:33.155
- My friends, we have to
stop meeting like this.


01:03:33.157 --> 01:03:34.790
- You know this frog?


01:03:34.792 --> 01:03:36.291
- Mr. Monster!


01:03:36.293 --> 01:03:38.393
- All these orcs begin
to act strangely.


01:03:38.395 --> 01:03:41.163
So, like I say,
when trouble is afoot,


01:03:41.165 --> 01:03:42.831
it is good to have long legs.


01:03:42.833 --> 01:03:45.534
- We need to get
to Elfdale right away,


01:03:45.536 --> 01:03:47.402
but we're out of gas.


01:03:47.404 --> 01:03:48.537
Can you help us?


01:03:48.539 --> 01:03:51.306
- But of course.
Hop in.


01:03:51.442 --> 01:03:55.577
So why is your car
on top of a tree?


01:04:04.721 --> 01:04:06.455
- Thanks.


01:04:06.457 --> 01:04:09.157
Sophie, we can never repay you.


01:04:09.159 --> 01:04:13.695
- If what you say is true, it
is us who will be in your debt.


01:04:13.697 --> 01:04:16.665
- Don't stop in Elfdale.
Keep going.


01:04:16.667 --> 01:04:17.833
- Of course.


01:04:17.835 --> 01:04:20.102
- You're my new best friend.


01:04:20.104 --> 01:04:22.237
- You're my new best friend too.


01:04:30.614 --> 01:04:33.648
- Looks like you made
a new friend there.


01:04:33.650 --> 01:04:35.550
- A new bestie, I think.


01:04:35.552 --> 01:04:36.351
- Careful, Barl.


01:04:36.353 --> 01:04:39.821
People might think you're
an e-orc with a heart of gold.


01:04:39.823 --> 01:04:44.192
- I'm totally that!
That's my thing!


01:04:44.194 --> 01:04:45.227
- Oh, really?


01:04:45.229 --> 01:04:46.361
- Could be!


01:04:46.363 --> 01:04:47.462
- Hmm.


01:04:47.464 --> 01:04:48.730
- Anything?


01:04:48.732 --> 01:04:50.298
- Almost.


01:04:50.300 --> 01:04:51.833
Any sign on Zombie Rolf?


01:04:51.835 --> 01:04:54.870
- Um, nope, not yet.


01:04:54.872 --> 01:04:56.338
- Got it!


01:04:56.340 --> 01:04:59.274
Whoa!
It's so shiny!


01:04:59.276 --> 01:05:00.809
- Okay, now what?


01:05:00.811 --> 01:05:03.512
- Keep it away from Rolf!


01:05:04.648 --> 01:05:06.148
- Scrap!


01:05:06.150 --> 01:05:09.151
I am your master!


01:05:09.153 --> 01:05:11.386
Do my bidding!


01:05:11.388 --> 01:05:16.324
- I hope your first order is
for me to feed you this rock!


01:05:16.326 --> 01:05:17.926
- That's not funny, Barl!


01:05:17.928 --> 01:05:19.494
- It wasn't supposed to be.


01:05:19.496 --> 01:05:22.397
But I can see how my accent
was a bit funny.


01:05:22.399 --> 01:05:24.799
I just wanted to see
if you felt anything.


01:05:24.801 --> 01:05:25.867
You didn't, right?


01:05:25.869 --> 01:05:29.271
It's nothing without
the other half!


01:05:29.273 --> 01:05:29.738
- Lloyd!


01:05:29.740 --> 01:05:31.706
Fantastic that I ran into you.


01:05:31.708 --> 01:05:35.844
I just had a meeting with
the rep from Krune University.


01:05:35.846 --> 01:05:38.180
- Hi, Principal Ashford!


01:05:38.182 --> 01:05:39.581
- Oh, hey.


01:05:39.583 --> 01:05:42.584
Hey, I didn't think I'd see you,
Barl,


01:05:42.586 --> 01:05:44.319
but here you are.


01:05:44.321 --> 01:05:44.920
- Uh, yeah.


01:05:44.922 --> 01:05:47.956
- Hi. I'm Scrap.
I'm from New Orc City.


01:05:47.958 --> 01:05:50.192
Let's walk away from
the statue, shall we?


01:05:50.194 --> 01:05:53.361
- Yeah, we should walk over
there that way because...


01:05:53.363 --> 01:05:57.899
- Uh, she's a representative
from New Orc University.


01:05:57.968 --> 01:06:02.337
- NOU is a very
good school, but...


01:06:02.339 --> 01:06:04.606
- Great school!


01:06:04.608 --> 01:06:06.274
- Options are always good,


01:06:06.276 --> 01:06:11.213
but this elf is going to my
alma mater, Krune University.


01:06:11.215 --> 01:06:13.515
- We'll see about that.


01:06:16.553 --> 01:06:19.354
- Well, I can't wait
to hear your speech, Lloyd.


01:06:19.356 --> 01:06:20.989
I'm sure it's gonna
be very impressive!


01:06:20.991 --> 01:06:24.559
- Yes, sir!
Can't wait to hear it myself.


01:06:24.561 --> 01:06:25.527
- Graduation!


01:06:25.529 --> 01:06:28.530
- Oh, Gnome Biscuits!
Graduation is today!


01:06:28.532 --> 01:06:30.932
I completely forgot!
- How much time do we have?


01:06:35.806 --> 01:06:38.240
- Um, now!


01:06:40.577 --> 01:06:41.543
- Where are we going?


01:06:41.545 --> 01:06:43.278
- Mr. Pickens's classroom!
- Who's that?


01:06:43.280 --> 01:06:46.514
- Everyone knows Mr. Pickens.
He's our rock teacher.


01:06:46.516 --> 01:06:47.449
- You mean mineralogist?


01:06:47.451 --> 01:06:51.820
- We're gonna throw rocks at
Rolf and his zombie orcs?


01:06:51.822 --> 01:06:52.520
- No!


01:06:52.522 --> 01:06:54.856
I'm gonna create a spell so the
two halves can't stick together!


01:06:54.858 --> 01:06:56.524
- And if they don't stick...


01:06:56.526 --> 01:06:57.926
- We don't graduate!


01:06:57.928 --> 01:06:58.860
- No!
- No!


01:06:58.862 --> 01:07:00.729
Then he can't mind
control us elves!


01:07:00.731 --> 01:07:04.799
- Okay, but I still think
we should throw rocks at him.


01:07:05.469 --> 01:07:07.002
- Next rock?


01:07:07.004 --> 01:07:08.270
- Agate!


01:07:08.272 --> 01:07:09.371
- Agate up!


01:07:09.373 --> 01:07:11.439
Coming at you.


01:07:11.942 --> 01:07:14.643
Wow, good crushing, Barl!


01:07:14.645 --> 01:07:15.777
- Calcite!


01:07:15.779 --> 01:07:16.878
- Calcite?


01:07:16.880 --> 01:07:17.812
- Um, over there!


01:07:17.814 --> 01:07:22.751
- Ladies and gentlemen,
please take your seats


01:07:22.753 --> 01:07:24.352
in our beautiful gymnasium


01:07:24.354 --> 01:07:28.590
to begin Elfdale High's
graduation ceremony.


01:07:28.592 --> 01:07:31.459
- We have to hurry before
the graduation starts.


01:07:31.461 --> 01:07:33.028
Rolf is gonna be
here any second!


01:07:33.030 --> 01:07:35.463
- Too late.
He's here.


01:07:35.465 --> 01:07:37.966
- Lloyd, you need
to tell Principal Ashford


01:07:37.968 --> 01:07:39.868
to stop the graduation!


01:07:39.870 --> 01:07:41.036
- What? No! Why?


01:07:41.038 --> 01:07:42.737
- People are gonna get hurt!


01:07:42.739 --> 01:07:46.041
Mom and Dad are out there!
Friends!


01:07:46.043 --> 01:07:49.878
- Orcs? Elves?
Gnomes? Goblins?


01:07:49.880 --> 01:07:51.313
- He'll listen to you.


01:07:51.315 --> 01:07:54.849
From me, he'll just
think it's another prank.


01:07:58.588 --> 01:08:01.089
- You go.
I got this.


01:08:02.092 --> 01:08:03.425
- What about us?


01:08:03.427 --> 01:08:06.027
- Easy. We grab the other
stone from Rolf.


01:08:06.029 --> 01:08:08.897
- Sure, easy.


01:08:38.428 --> 01:08:40.395
- Whoa!


01:08:43.900 --> 01:08:49.971
- Excuse me, but do you know
where the gymnasium is?


01:08:50.440 --> 01:08:51.373
- Around the corner.


01:08:51.375 --> 01:08:54.642
- I said, where
the gymnasium is?


01:08:54.644 --> 01:08:57.112
I think I got turned around.


01:08:57.114 --> 01:08:59.647
- Over there, around the corner.


01:08:59.649 --> 01:09:03.151
- What? You ate a quarter?


01:09:04.121 --> 01:09:05.387
- It's over there!


01:09:05.389 --> 01:09:08.590
- Oh, thank you, young lady.


01:09:12.662 --> 01:09:14.829
- Gnome Biscuits!


01:09:14.831 --> 01:09:16.931
- Barl, I hear them!


01:09:20.070 --> 01:09:21.770
- Miss me?


01:09:21.772 --> 01:09:24.873
- My, what big feet you have.


01:09:24.875 --> 01:09:27.876
- The better to stomp you with.


01:09:27.878 --> 01:09:30.545
- My, what big fists you have.


01:09:30.547 --> 01:09:34.416
- The better to pound you with.


01:09:34.418 --> 01:09:36.518
- What big eyes you have.


01:09:36.520 --> 01:09:38.486
- The better to... argh!


01:09:38.488 --> 01:09:40.655
- Ha! You missed us!
- Stop this!


01:09:40.657 --> 01:09:42.056
Stop this right now!


01:09:42.058 --> 01:09:45.093
Elves and orcs
live together in peace!


01:09:45.095 --> 01:09:45.894
You hear me?


01:09:45.896 --> 01:09:48.496
- Let go of her!
She's my friend!


01:09:48.498 --> 01:09:51.499
- Barl! Run! I got this.


01:09:55.071 --> 01:09:56.104
- Barl, are you all right?


01:09:56.106 --> 01:09:58.973
- Scrap! She... she...
and then Rolf went...


01:09:58.975 --> 01:10:02.777
and then she said, "I got this"
and then she didn't!


01:10:02.779 --> 01:10:04.879
- Okay, okay.
We'll save her!


01:10:04.881 --> 01:10:07.048
I have an idea.
- What is it?


01:10:07.050 --> 01:10:10.618
- I am going to graduate.


01:10:12.055 --> 01:10:13.988
- Cool.


01:10:21.031 --> 01:10:25.600
- Oh, hi, sweetheart.
I'm still lost.


01:10:25.602 --> 01:10:29.103
Can you point me
to the gymnasium?


01:10:32.609 --> 01:10:34.142
- What?


01:10:34.144 --> 01:10:36.678
- There's the gym!


01:10:38.849 --> 01:10:39.981
- Teenager.


01:10:39.983 --> 01:10:44.719
- Ceremonies that celebrated
academic excellence date back


01:10:44.721 --> 01:10:47.856
as far as the 12th century


01:10:47.858 --> 01:10:50.124
known to us
in the academic world


01:10:50.126 --> 01:10:51.793
as the Proto-Germanic Period


01:10:51.795 --> 01:10:53.928
where clerics developed
the taste for Elderberry wine.


01:10:53.930 --> 01:10:55.864
- There you are.
We've been waiting for you.


01:10:55.866 --> 01:10:56.664
Your speech?


01:10:56.666 --> 01:10:58.233
- Awesome.
I'm totally ready.


01:10:58.235 --> 01:11:01.536
I'm not gonna improvise, though,
if that's what you're thinking.


01:11:01.538 --> 01:11:05.273
- Didn't think it
for even a moment.


01:11:05.275 --> 01:11:07.208
Cap? Gown?


01:11:07.210 --> 01:11:09.911
- Part of my speech.


01:11:09.913 --> 01:11:11.012
- Of course.


01:11:11.014 --> 01:11:14.849
- And that is how
an elephant got its spots.


01:11:14.851 --> 01:11:17.619
Now...
- Thank you, Miss Tenderfoot.


01:11:17.621 --> 01:11:20.188
Everyone?
Miss Tenderfoot!


01:11:21.825 --> 01:11:23.224
- But I'm...


01:11:23.226 --> 01:11:26.027
- Ladies and gentlemen,
it is my honor...


01:11:29.666 --> 01:11:33.067
Ladies and gentlemen,
it is my honor...


01:11:42.546 --> 01:11:47.549
It is my honor to present to
you this year's Valedictorian,


01:11:47.551 --> 01:11:50.118
Lloyd Lightspinner!


01:11:56.560 --> 01:12:00.295
- Thank you, Principal Ashford,
student body,


01:12:00.297 --> 01:12:02.764
special members of the audience.


01:12:02.766 --> 01:12:05.833
I cannot thank you enough
for your warm reception.


01:12:05.835 --> 01:12:08.970
You would not
believe the journey it has been


01:12:08.972 --> 01:12:11.306
to get here today.


01:12:13.810 --> 01:12:18.846
No, seriously, the past few days
have given me


01:12:18.848 --> 01:12:21.583
a lot to think about,


01:12:21.585 --> 01:12:25.219
about what all
of this means to me.


01:12:25.221 --> 01:12:28.323
High school, graduation,


01:12:28.325 --> 01:12:32.060
college, and I realize...


01:12:38.034 --> 01:12:40.335
I realize that...


01:12:40.337 --> 01:12:43.871
graduation is a time that...


01:12:43.873 --> 01:12:46.307
brings people together.


01:12:46.309 --> 01:12:49.811
We are honored today
to have members


01:12:49.813 --> 01:12:52.313
of the orc community here.


01:12:52.315 --> 01:12:54.215
Let's give them a hand, folks.


01:13:00.624 --> 01:13:04.025
They brought with them
a gift to share as well,


01:13:04.027 --> 01:13:06.995
a sign of togetherness.


01:13:09.633 --> 01:13:11.866
Behold!


01:13:16.072 --> 01:13:18.072
- That's...


01:13:20.310 --> 01:13:21.943
- Mine!


01:13:28.018 --> 01:13:30.985
- You want this, Rolf?


01:13:30.987 --> 01:13:32.120
Do you?


01:13:32.122 --> 01:13:33.154
Well you can't have this!


01:13:33.156 --> 01:13:37.792
Because orcs and elves have been
living in peace for 1,000 years!


01:13:37.794 --> 01:13:43.665
And when I break this, they
will live in peace forever!


01:13:47.871 --> 01:13:49.404
- No!


01:13:51.741 --> 01:13:54.042
- Gnome Biscuits.


01:14:01.251 --> 01:14:04.185
- Enjoy your party, elves!


01:14:04.187 --> 01:14:07.088
From now until eternity,


01:14:07.090 --> 01:14:10.692
orcs will rule the world!


01:14:13.730 --> 01:14:20.835
Totalus Controlus!


01:14:28.244 --> 01:14:32.246
- Oh, hey, Forelle.
What's happening?


01:14:32.248 --> 01:14:35.116
- Um, that big smelly orc


01:14:35.118 --> 01:14:39.754
just got bigger and smellier.


01:14:39.756 --> 01:14:41.756
Pretty scary, actually.


01:14:41.758 --> 01:14:42.724
- Your milk!


01:14:42.726 --> 01:14:44.726
- Wait. Stop.


01:14:44.728 --> 01:14:46.494
- Sorry.


01:15:17.127 --> 01:15:20.528
- You think petty pranks
will stop me?


01:15:20.530 --> 01:15:25.032
- No, but this should.


01:15:25.034 --> 01:15:28.002
Freezey peazy,
lemon squeezy!


01:15:35.445 --> 01:15:38.079
- No!


01:15:58.134 --> 01:15:59.934
- I'm me.


01:15:59.936 --> 01:16:01.502
I'm me!


01:16:03.406 --> 01:16:06.207
- I have a headache.


01:16:08.178 --> 01:16:11.279
- Help!
Somebody help...


01:16:17.520 --> 01:16:20.421
- Barl!
- Lloyd!


01:16:22.425 --> 01:16:24.258
- Barl!


01:16:24.260 --> 01:16:25.059
- We did it!


01:16:25.061 --> 01:16:27.895
- You did it!
This was your plan, brother!


01:16:27.897 --> 01:16:31.432
- Well, it was your magic!


01:16:31.434 --> 01:16:32.567
- Lightspinner!


01:16:32.569 --> 01:16:38.005
That was the greatest speech
in Elfdale history!


01:16:38.007 --> 01:16:39.006
Congratulations, Lloyd!


01:16:39.008 --> 01:16:41.909
No doubt you're Krune
University material!


01:16:41.911 --> 01:16:45.079
Your heroics will be talked
about for centuries!


01:16:45.081 --> 01:16:47.014
- You're gonna take that?


01:16:47.016 --> 01:16:49.450
- Yeah.
You know, Lloyd's right.


01:16:49.452 --> 01:16:52.153
Maybe I'm not cut out
to be the hero.


01:16:52.155 --> 01:16:56.357
I kind of like fart jokes
and snot bombs.


01:16:56.359 --> 01:16:58.860
- Me too.


01:16:58.862 --> 01:17:00.628
- Huh?


01:17:01.264 --> 01:17:06.000
- Folks, I'd like to finish
my speech if it's okay.


01:17:08.504 --> 01:17:12.640
I know it's easy to get
lost in this moment.


01:17:12.642 --> 01:17:15.376
Our freedom was almost
taken from us today.


01:17:15.378 --> 01:17:18.913
So when the history books
write about this day,


01:17:18.915 --> 01:17:23.951
they just need
to remember one person:


01:17:23.953 --> 01:17:28.623
Barl Lightspinner, my brother.


01:17:28.625 --> 01:17:31.425
He's the real deal, folks.


01:17:31.427 --> 01:17:32.393
These last few days,


01:17:32.395 --> 01:17:37.298
he taught me what it's like
to be a real hero.


01:17:37.300 --> 01:17:41.202
He showed me strength,
trust, brains,


01:17:41.204 --> 01:17:45.673
friendship,
even a little bit of magic.


01:17:46.676 --> 01:17:47.675
Barl?


01:17:48.478 --> 01:17:50.978
- Barl! Barl!


01:17:50.980 --> 01:17:53.080
- Go on, Barl. Go!


01:17:58.588 --> 01:18:00.321
- Um...


01:18:16.439 --> 01:18:19.974
- Hey! I know that guy!


01:18:19.976 --> 01:18:24.412
- Huh?
You want salami on rye?

